<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Thu Oct 03 2019 15:34:20 GMT-0400 (EDT) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jos.</para>
  <para style="mt">Joshua</para>
  <para style="mt">Joshua Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide pe mpaube zi teu eh samdibe teilu. Joshua de Tinggwang ne Moses ketsaidwa siakdau kedetlu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Joshua laisiukwak de au Joshua nah Israel ha, penui Tinggwang ngha teu eh, Sampet kebeube Deu de kegwa-Canaan. Minadung miswakegah tei eh Jordan Reuki kahkelu nah Jericho nam gwakelu. Pecai, Tinggwang ngha teudai eh, penui zette Canaan deu kekieelebie luu kelu ha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Joshua tsaikedi dwa, pa minadung de Tinggwang gu samkak sampet kebeudung de ranglia daibeu. Pa minadung de Tinggwang de hung nah pe samzai teibam lulo ledeu beu. Mteidwade, pa Tinggwang gwa teikeneu sam ranggai, “nnui ziemne henai nnui caube gwatei ziebi kedet lulo, Dede a ziemne nah a kelak au, anui Tinggwang gwatei zie.” (24:15).</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Canaan gumlu kera mteikecu (1:1-5:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Canaan kegwa (6:1-12:24)</para>
  <para style="io1">Heleuhdung kakga kideu kemzi (13:1-21:45)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kenuikegai nah Joshua tsit (22:1-24:33)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube Joshua dage samkekai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses tsai kedicai, RAMPAUBE, Nun napei Joshua, Moses de kenghame reu kedibe da ranggai, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Moses, a kilabe tsai dida. Cu ciziemne cuhlu Jordan Reuki aide kahpetlu, nang nah Israel mina aidung pelane, Ih penuide hangdeu peulai kebam deu dega, Israel namedung de. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Ih Moses da rang kebeude nzwa, nnui pi hi kegai leuga Ih nnuide peu dida. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Lebanon hetaideu gade, Euphrate reuki kedi kecang, Hittime deu pelane nah Mediterranean Jaaidi, naimiak kenlütle kecang nnui deurai zie. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />N teilung pelane ga migede n dwa sap gailak, Ih Moses da kelade nzwa Ih nda lazie. Ih ncu gi dilak mede püt dilak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:5">Heb. 13:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Ngkieng nah kuu lu, kedanemene Ih nnui paumedung da sampet kai kebeude nzwa n mabam gade mina aidungde de hangdeu gum luzie. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Nnui kuu nah ngkingsüt lu, a kilabe Moses ne hezai kai kebeudung de pelane sünne eh mzailu, hile nah zetle nreutet diso, cinzwa lucai nang tetkela leuga mteu luzie. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Aipau hezai laisiukwak de nnui mui gade tet dilak, tingmui tingba nang cide cetncok luzie, cinzwa lucai raukenzeu dungde nang sünne eh pelane mzai lubui, ciude n lampui yi luzie nah mteu luzie. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Ih n dage aja kaigai meni? Ngking nah kuu lu! Ngngi diso; n suisa diso, kedanemene RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang nang tetkela leuga ncu ngngwala lu.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Ge Joshua heleuhbe muiteumedung da aja kai eh, ranggai <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Ramzeuki sum ga mie cu delwe minadung da rang eh, ‘Nnui teumai kesiadung mtei lu, nnui lang cumne gage Jordan reuki aide kahpet luzie RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnui kepeu deu de mie gumlu kera.’”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Reubenme, Gadme nah Manasseh leuh pempie dage Joshua ranggai, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“RAMPAUBE kila Moses sam nnuida kai kebeu dungde nsung lalu de ranggai, ‘RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kemtak nah hangdeu aide peubam dida.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Nnui naudung, nnui namedung, nnui kauruine Jordan gwalebie Moses ne nnuide kepeu deu ga bamzie. Dede nnui hereu keteime reunet, nnui reugwa kengkingme pelane nnui siname dwade kahpet, delwe penuide ngha zie <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />RAMPAUBE nnuide kemtak kepeu de nzwa n siname de kemtak peu kemaktane, iciu eh penui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne penuide kepeu deu de gum luzie. Pecai nnui magum deu dega cailigwang eh RAMPAUBE kila Moses ne nnuide kepeu hangdeu naimiak kepetle Jordan Reuki kahpet kecu deu de gum luzie.” <verse eid="JOS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Ge penui Joshua sam keli eh ranggai, “Nang anuide aja kekai leune anui teizie nah nang kehei ga anuide langgai de anui mie zie. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Anui Moses sam mzai kelunzwa anui n sam mzai zie. Pa Moses da kelade nzwa eh RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang depeu n da la kelube teilu. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Keheibede nang samkai kebeudung de mlai dicai, mede n samdung mzai luta dicai nang pecu teilo kebeu leune, pecu ketsai ga kai dizie. Cine ngking nah kuu lu.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Rahab nah reketme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Pecai Nun napei Joshua ngkiem eh hangna gede Shittim gade reketme ge nzwa nah ainzwa ranggai, “Mie hangdeu pielo, keraide Jericho namdi de.” Penai mielwe helipui ki ge ga gwanglu, pe zi cai Rahab, nah cika penai mtaklu. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Jericho gwangpei da ainzwa ranggai, “Pielo, mina tingmuiziu aika hangdeu pie kera Israel name gwangla.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Jericho gwangpei Rahab da sam langgai, “N ki ga gwang kebam hangna de teu mpetlu nda gwang kebambe de, kedanemene penai hangdeu pelane pie kera gwangla lu.” <verse eid="JOS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Dede mipuide mipei hangna de teu kebai di nah pa ranggai, “Yeo, mi hangna ada gwang da dede Ih penai dai gade gwangla bi cima.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:25">Jas. 2:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Nah muilüt eh namdi kirie ngkui kera ting dige penai tetdi. Penai daiga miedi bie kecu Ih au cima. Penai cai sui kelwa mie cu iciu cai nnui penaide gwakah lubui.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Dede pa penaide kipeu ga ngngwa nghang lwe penaide reigau gage kebaidi (pa reigaudung keu mpet kipeu gage kaidi). <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Cine minadung Jordan lampui ga kecang penai de gwazui miedi. Nah penaide gwazui miedi herizi namdi kirie ngkuidi.<verse eid="JOS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Reketme hangna de zeu mtak mene bam pa kipeu ga penai da nghang kecu dau. <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />Ge pa reketme da rangdi, “Ih cibam RAMPAUBE ne nnui de aipau deu de kepeu nah anui da nnui de kehing de anui reu cakmie, nah keheibe de aipau deu ga kelungme nnui dwade tuii dizie. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Kedanemene anui siuda dainzwa RAMPAUBE nnui dwa dui Jaaidi Kegie tei cangbeu bi kecu nnui Egypt gade kempet tingdau nah Jordan kahpet Amorme gwangpei kena de nnui dai teidi bi kecu, Sihon de nah Og de, penaide ngkapzing kedi. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Anui cidung de siulu herizi anui nlung tuiidi nah anui mige dade kekuu rabe be bam si tadi nnui ziemne, nnui RAMPAUBE Tinggwang ziemne, Pa au tinggim nreule ga nah kideu ngkang gade Tinggwang kecune. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Cu kehereide RAMPAUBE zi gade a dage sampet gailu, Ih nnai dade a zai keyi de nzwa, nnaide a pei ki kelakdung dade nnai zai yi kera, nah kelibeu bizie cu rengei ge keulia beulo acu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb. 11:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />nang peu a pei, nah a pui, nah a sinapeime, nah a sinapuime de peu ringlo nah penui pelane de, nah nang anui de ketsai gade ringlu kera.” <verse eid="JOS 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Nah penai pe dage rangdi, “Anai teilung ketsai kecang ndage peu gaila! Nang magade mi ge dade anui tadung rangdi mai, iciu cai RAMPAUBE anui de hangdeu kepeu dau n dade anui zai yi luzie nah samsang luzie.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Cine pa penai de hebaki ga heria kailwe peu nghung kera sau beu, kedanemene pa namdi kirie ga peki teipwa lung bam kelane namdi kirie ga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:25">Jas. 2:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Pa penai da rangdi, “Hangdeutudung ga mie mbaih dilu nnuide zuikelame de nnai redau lubui lu nah cika langcumne mbaih lu, zuikelame cailigwang kemakta ne nah cipaucai nnai lampui ga ge tetgai lubui.” <verse eid="JOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Pecai penai pe dage rang eh, “Nang anai depeu aipau ngu sampet ga sampet kegai nzwa anui zai yi luzie. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Ainie! Anui hangdeu ga gwang la dida, nang heria aide keulu maisia anai de hebaki gade peu kenghung de ga nah n pei, n pui, n siname nah n pei kilungme pelane n ki ga nlüt dilu. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Nah keheibe de n kikam gwale lampui ga mpet cai, penui jai de penui peu reu ga zie nah anui mzeu zie. Dede magade keheibe de nnui kiga kebam mede penui ba kai cai cipaume jai au anui peuga da. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Dede nang magade anai tadung de rang dicai, anui mzeu dizie ngu sampet kegai nzwa nang anaide sampet kegaide.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Nah pa rangdi, “Nnai samde nzwa tei luzie.” Cine pa penaide lang gidi nah penai tetdi nah pa pai kegie ge hebaki gage keu gaidi.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Cipaucai penai tetdi nah hangdeutudung ga gwanglwe langcumne cika bamdi, nah penuide zuikelame cailigwang kemaktane, nah penui lampui leune ga peeila de ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Nah reketme kena hangdeutudung gade nghung lwe cailigwanglu nah kahpet lwe Nun napei Joshua da gwang eh penai de daitei dibi pelane pedage pauswa gaibeu. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Penui Joshua da rangdi, “Kesanglie RAMPAUBE hangdeu pelane anui ba gage kaibeu nah cipau hangdeu ga lung kebam pelane anui ziemne tuii ga dida.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Jordan kekah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Joshua tingcang nuge cuhlwe, penui Shittim gade tet mpetdi eh penui Jordan Reuki ga gwanglu, pa nah Israel namedung, penui kahpetdi kemakne cika ramzeu lu. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Nah cide langcumne cang gwang kecu dau kedime ramzeuki sum gade tetpet; <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />nah penui minadung da ajah kai eh ranggai, “RAMPAUBE Nnui Tinggwang gu samkakbung pungla eh ngau keludau, nah Levi cingkume ne pung la eh, nnui bam gade tet mpet lu maisia nah cide mzui lu. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Iciuliede nnui kakga petie cubit cang na<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit cang na </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilometer pie ge kenzwa. </char></note> kenzwa ge kainzeu lu, cipau taiga gwang mna so, cinzwa lude nnui dai lampui ga tetgai laubi ci luzie, kedanemene ndaa nnui aipau lampui kahgwang melu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Cine Joshua minadung da rangdi, “Ncünne ziemne nnui katei nnuide tei mcilu, RAMPAUBE nnui kakga miswakega bata teigai zie.” <verse eid="JOS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Pecai Joshua cingkume da ranggai, “Samkakbung pwa ncuhlu, nah minadung dwaga tetlu.” Cine penui samkakbung pwa lwe mina dwaga petdi.<verse eid="JOS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />RAMPAUBE Joshua dade rangdi, “Henai tingba gade Israelme pelane miakdung gade Ih ncu teu ncuh beuzie da, Ih Moses da kela nzwa Ih nda de lalie kecu penui cilu kera. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Nang ne cingkume samkakbung pwa kelame de aja kaizie, ‘Nnui Jordan reukung dui penli ga gwang keludau nnui cika Jordan ga sap lulo.’” <verse eid="JOS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Joshua Israel namedung da rangdi, “Gwang nna lwe RAMPAUBE Tinggwang samdung kingneilu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Ge Joshua rangdi, “Aide gade nnui ci lu zie ring kela Tinggwang nnui da la kecu nah pa nnui dwa gade gwagi bi dizie nah Canaanme, Hittime, Hivitme, Perizzme, Girgashme, Amorme, nah Jebusime dwa gade nnuide keli beuzie. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Pielo! Samkakbung kideu pelane gu RAMPAUBE gu de nnui dwa rai eh Jordan lungga lüt. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Cu nang nkatei nziemne mina hang kereiekena de kedetlu, Israelme leuh kakde nah heleuh ket gade hange ge kecu. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Nah cinzwa eh cingkume, kideu pelane reu RAMPAUBE, samkakbung de pung kelame pideu Jordan duidung ga gwang mtaklu de, Jordan duidung de mbai mpet dizie nah nreule de duidung lwa kemie dung de heni gega ngkwa bam dizie.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Cine cipaucai minadung penui ramzeukidung gade mpet lwe Jordan kahpet lu kera Cingkume samkakbung pung kelame ne penui dwa rai eh. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Samkakbung pung kelame Jordan ga gwang canglu herizi nah cingkume samkakbung pung kelame pi duikung penli ga hi gai herizi (cu Jordan reu kungdung pelane dui puipet di lulwet ting kecang), <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />dui nreule de lwa nghung kebamdung de piage gage lwacaili daidi, Adam namdi dei süt kecu gade, Zarethan taiga namdi kebam de, nah Arabah duidi ga lwamie kebamdungde ga, Ketsai Jaaidi de dangdi eh minadung Jericho nam taiga kahpet lu. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Nah Cingkume RAMPAUBE samkakbung pung kelame Jordan reu deucang sumga sap mtip bamdi nah Israel leuhme pelane Jordan kahpet deucang ga canglu kemaktane.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Nah heleuh pelane Jordan kahpet canglu, cipaucai RAMPAUBE Joshua da rangdi. <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Mina hang kereiekena de nkatei nziemne kedet lu minadung kak gade, heleuh ge gade hange gede. <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />Nah penuide aja kai eh ranggai, ‘Cingkume Jordan reuki sumga sap kebam gade nnui katei nnui ziemne tangtsukangdung kereiekena aika de, Jordan sum ga cingkume sap mtip kebam ga nah cidung de nnui da keugwang lu, nah cidung de pwa nnui heziu mtak kera bam ga kailu.’” <verse eid="JOS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Pecai Joshua Israel namedung kakde pa mina hang kereiekena ge de kedet kelumedung de kugai heleuh ge gade hange gede. <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />Nah Joshua penui da rangdi, “Nnui Tinggwang RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwaga tetlu, Jordan reuki sumga nah nnui hangge ge de tangtsukang ket pe hekeutu gage pwa gailu, Israel namedung heleuh kebam kiege. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Tangtsukang aide ne nnui kakga marehi ge zie, aipaucai nnui namedung ne tangtsudung aide pekie daino de rang eh keteu cai? <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Cidau nang penui da rangzie, ‘RAMPAUBE samkakbung pwakah kecudau Jordan duidung lwa mtakdi Jordan kahpet kecudau.’ Cine aipau tangtsudung de Israel namedung kelungta nsungla dizie.”<verse eid="JOS 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Israel namedung Joshua ajah kekai de nzwa teilu, nah penui tangtsudung kereiekena Jordan reuki sum gade pa ncuhlu, RAMPAUBE Joshua da kerang de nzwa. Israel namedung heleuh kebam kieege penui punggwang penui ramzeuki tei eh mtak kera heni gage cidungde kailu. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Pecaide Joshua Jordan reuki sumga ge tangtsudung kereiekena de kaiswalu, cingkume samkakbung pung kelame pi kang gage. Nah cide henai kecang de cika bam. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Cingkume samkakbung pung kelame Jordan sumga saplu, RAMPAUBE Joshua da ajah kai kebeudung de pelane mina dage rang canglu kemak tane, Moses ne Joshua da ajah kekai pelane de nzwa, cine minadung kelwa eh penui hereuki kahpetlu. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Ge mina pelane kahpet kelu cai, Cingkume RAMPAUBE samkakbung pung kelame penui dwa kapet di. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Ge Reuben name, nah Gad name, nah Manasseh leuh pempie mina hereu tei kera mteilwe Israel name dwaga kahpetlu, Moses penuide rang kebeude nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />RAMPAUBE dwaga reugwame mina cang riakdai ge kenzwa mteilwe Jericho langkie ga hereu tei kera kahpetlu. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Cipaunai RAMPAUBE Joshua de Israelme pelane miak dwa gade teu ncuh beu, penui pecu hetwa peudi, Moses de penui hetwa kepeu nzwa, pe teilung pelane.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Joshua da ranggai, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Cingkume samkakbung zierang pung kelame de aja kai eh peu Jordan gade nghang lu.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Cine Joshua cingkume de ajah kaigai eh ranggai, “Jordan gade nghang lu.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Ge cingkume RAMPAUBE samkakbung pung kelame Jordan sum gade tet nghang lwe cingkume penui pideu hangdeu kecang gage kai kedicai Jordan kereuki duidung lwacaili pebam ga gwangdi pedwa lwakebam nzwa eh pekungdungde pelane puipet daidi.<verse eid="JOS 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Minadung kei raitube ziangrei benai Jordan gade nghang lu nah penui Gilgal ga ramzeuki teilu naimiak kepetle Jericho kung ga. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Tangtsukangdung kereiekena penui Jordan gade pung nghang kelade, Joshua ne Gilgal ga sum gailu. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Nah pa Israel napeidung da marang eh ranggai, “Aipaucai nnui napeidung penui peidung de keteu eh, ‘tangtsudung aidungde daino?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Ciciude nnui nnui napeidung de peu cilu eh rang zie, ‘Israelme Jordan hangdeu kecang aide ga kahpet lu.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne anui dwaga Jordan duidung de teicang beu, nnui tetka petlu kemaktane, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang Jaaidi kegie anui dwaga pa tei cang kebeu nzwa nnui kapet kemaktane, <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />iciude kideu ga mina pelane RAMPAUBE baga kengkieng kebam de cilu kerane iciu eh kelungta Rampaube nnui Tinggwang mie hing luzie.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="s">Gilgal Gade Hegeukerum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Cidau Amorme gwangpeidung pelane, Jordan naimiak kenlütle kebammedung nah Canaanme gwangpeidung pelane, Jaaidi ga kebamme RAMPAUBE ne Israel namedung ziemne Jordan ga duidi de penui kahpetlu kemaktane teicang beukedi siulu penui mlung tuiidi, nah rabe penuida bamsi tadi Israel namedung ziemne.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE Joshua da rangdi, “Nkatei nziemne kieceudung teilwe pia kenabe tei eh Israel namedung geurumlu kemakme geurum lu.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Ge Joshua pa kieceudung pe ziemne teilwe Gibeath Haaraloth<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lungtakedi detu</char></note> deutu gade Israel namedung geurumlu. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Egypt gade mina mpetkelu leu mipeinadung hereu keteimedung, penui gwang kela hetaideu kecuk lampui ga tsai kedime; penui Egypt gade mpet kelu cai aipau kie de ziemne Joshua penui geurumlu. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Kedanemene Cika de mpetkelu leu hegeurum ludi, dede Egypt gade mpetlu eh hetaideu ga kela tingdau mnakelu leune hegeurum ma. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Israel namedung hetaideu ga mmi riakdai tetgwang, Egypt gade mpet kelu heleuh pelane gade mipei hereu teilu kebuime de ngkap ciakdi kemaktane, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lu kemakne. RAMPAUBE penui paume dage hangdeu tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam de anuide peu zielie sampet kebeu de peu penuide ngau lak lie penui dage sampetdi. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Dede pa penui nding ga penui napeidung Joshua ne hegeurum kelume de teu ncuhlu, hegeurumlu meliede, kedanemene penui hetaideu ga keladau hegeurumlu kemakne. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Cinzwa gwang heleuh pelane hegeurum cang kelucai, penui jamdung laidi kemakta Israelme pelane ramzeuki ga bamdi. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />Ge RAMPAUBE Joshua da rangdi, “Henai nnui dade Ih Egyptme gu hengamdung de keukezia dida.” Cine, henai kecang de heni zi cide Gilgal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrewme let gade Gilgal pekie “keugidi kecu” ciswade pekie cok gwa kecu ge cai “nla mpetdi kecu.” </char></note> lie qula.<verse eid="JOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Cine Israel namedung Gilgal ga ramzeuki teilu nah Kahkegwang ngyi cipaube kei zie ziangreiemdai benai mneilu, tinghegi Jericho langkie gade. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Kahkegwang tingba pecia benai, cipau benai, penui deu gade ngaukelube cehi kaikemak tangku nah ru kelu hebi tyeilu. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Penui deu gade ngau kelu taktyei cai benai gade manna ngausi tadi. Israelme namedung ziemne manna ngausi tadi, dede penui cipau tingkum de Canaan deudi gade ngau kelu de tyeilu.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jericho kaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Cinzwa eh Joshua Jericho tai ga kebam dau, pa ngang cuh eh piegai, ge ainie mige pe ba ga kingtie pwalwe pe dwa sap kebam ngau, Joshua peda mie nah peda rangdi, “Nang anui lambie mi anui ngauraume lambie no?” <verse eid="JOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Pa rangdi, “Kette ma.” Dede cu Ih RAMPAUBE gu reugwa muibe tei kera gwang la. Ge Joshua hangdeu ga keumie pecu reca eh rangdi, “Pe kilabe de a mpaube dai rang lano?” <verse eid="JOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />RAMPAUBE gu reugwa muibe Joshua dage rangdi, “N picum n pi gade keu mpet dilu, kedanemene nang sap kebam ni de mci lu,” Cine Joshua cide teilu.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Cu Jericho namdi kirie de kadi, Israel namedung ziemne. Migede hegwale mpet nah migede helungle nlüt ma. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />RAMPAUBE Joshua dage rangdi, “Pielo, Ih Jericho, pe hegwang nah pe kengkieng reugwame de n ba gage kaibeula. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Nang nah n reugwame Jericho namdi tet twagwa maisia, reugwame pelane namdi de piage tet twagwalu. Aide lang herokne tei maisia. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Cingkumedung hanghena meurünseu kii teluidung hena pwalwe samkakbung dwaga tet maisia. Pecai lang henane benai, nang namdi de pia hena tet twagwa maisia, nah cingkumedung telui kwa ngkiengsüt maisia. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Pecai ainzwa zie penui meurünseu kii de kwa ngkieng nah kwa tiesüt gailu de, nnui telui kwa siu kegai dau, mina pelane sahbak eh sahgai maisia, ciciude namdi rie kau mie dizie. Minadung, keheibe de nzuizang eh nghang dizie.” <verse eid="JOS 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Cine Nun napei Joshua cingkumedung de qulu delwe penui dade rangdi, “Samkak bung de pwalu, nah peu cingkumedung hang hena de meurünseu kii teluidung hena RAMPAUBE samkak bung dwa ga pwalu.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Pecai pa minadung dade rangdi, “Mie delwe namdibe ga tet twagwalu, nah reugwame RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwaga tet zie.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Joshua minadung dage rang kebeu de nzwa eh, cingkumedung hang hena meurünseu telui qidung hena pwalu eh RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwa tet rai lwe telui kwa, nah RAMPAUBE samkakbung pwa kelame de peu penui cai suilu. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Cingkume dwaga reugwame tetla, nah penui gu teluidung kwagai, nah pecai kekwamedung samkakbung caiga tetla, tet jüja teluidung kwa eh. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Dede Joshua minadung dage aja kai gai, “Masa so mede nnui kwa peu mide siuso, mede nnui mui gade samtie gede peu pet so Ih nnuide sah lulo de beu kemaktane. Iciude nnui sahlu maisia.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Cine pa RAMPAUBE samkakbung de peu namdi twagwalu, piage hui twagwa eh. Pecai penui penui ramzeuki ga nlütlu, nah penui cipau ziu ramzeuki ga bamlu.<verse eid="JOS 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Pecai Joshua tingcang nuge cuhlu, nah cingkumedung RAMPAUBE samkakbung de pwa cuhlu. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Cingkume hang hena meurünseu telui qidung hena pwa kelamedung RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwaga tet jüja la, nah teluidung kwala. Reugwame penui dwa ga tetla, dede pecai kekwame RAMPAUBE Samkakbung caiga tetla, penui teluidung kwa jüja la. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Lang pekenane benai penui namdi piage tet twagwa dailu nah ramzeuki ga caili gwanglu. Penui aide lang herokne teilu.<verse eid="JOS 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Cinzwa eh lang henane benai nuge tingba luge Israelme cuhlu, nah keda dau nzwa penui namdi de pia hena tet twagwalu, cipau nai rünne penui namdi de pia hena tet twagwa. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Cu cinzwa eh pe henabe pia, cingkume teluidung kwagai, nah Joshua minadung dade rangdi, “Sahgai! Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnuide namdi de peu dida lu. <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Namdi de, cide nah cika kebam leune de, tei msiadi kerane RAMPAUBE ziemne keu ntsam dida. Helipui Rahab rünne ringlu zie, pa nah peki ga pecu ngngwalung kebamme leune, kedanemene pa anui langkegai reketme de kebai kebeune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:25">Jas. 2:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Dede nnui ziemne au, maniadung tei msiadi kera keu ntsam pwa kebam gade nnui keu so, tei msiadi kera ziemne nnui keu ntsam kecu dau, nnui keu ntsam pwa kebam gade keu melu kerane, nah ciciu eh Israel ramzeuki de tei msiadi kera ziemne keu ntsam nah cika ge keherei teugwang gai melu kerane. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Rangkanggeu nah kecak, nah hetageu nah hegeu le tei keludung peciakne, cidungde RAMPAUBE dage keu ntsam gailu. Cidung de RAMPAUBE mabam gage kaibi maisia.” <verse eid="JOS 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Cine minadung sahgai nah penui teluidung kwagai. Cinzwa eh minadung telui kwa siulu ge, penui sahbak eh sahgai, ge namdi kirie de kau miedi, nah minadung namdi ga nghangdi, mileune de penui dwaga nzui jüja, nah penui namdi de tuilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:30">Heb. 11:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Penui namdi ga kebam peciakne de kingtie le teitset ciak dedi, mipei gade mipui kecang, hena gade hecing kecang, hetumseu, meurün, nah gada de de.<verse eid="JOS 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Pecai Joshua hangdeu reket kebam kena dade rangdi, “Helipui ki ga lüt cu, nah cikade mipuibe de nah peda kebamme pelane de ngngwa mpetlu, nnai pe dage sampet kebeu nzwa.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Cine reket ketei rehang kena de lütlu delwe Rahab, nah pepei, pepui, pe siname nah peda kebammedung pelane de ngngwa mpetlu, nah penui pe kibaume pelane de ngngwa mpetlu delwe penuide Israelme ramzeuki gwale ge kailu. <verse eid="JOS 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Penui namdi nah cika kebam peciakne mi le rudi. Kecak, rangkanggeu, hetageu nah hegeu lidung rünne, penui RAMPAUBE kerecaki mabam gage kailu. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Dede Joshua helipui Rahab nah pepei kibaume, nah peda kebam peciakne de peu ringlu. Pa Israelme kakga henai kecang de lunghla, kedanemene pa reketme Joshua ne Jericho de ncet kera lang kegai kena de kebai kebeune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb. 11:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Ge Joshua cipau tingdau penuide peu sampet eh ranggai, “Jericho, namdi aide teu cuh nah retak dai kecume de peu RAMPAUBE dwa gade reset pung kelube teilo. Pe bangdwa kecube pe neraibe pei de hiak zie, nah pe kiriedung tei cuh kecube pena henatube de hiak dizie.” <verse eid="JOS 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Cine RAMPAUBE au Joshua de ngngwala nah pe kendu de Canaan deudi leune ga zangra ladi.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Achan mau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Dede Israel napeidung mateimsia kera maniadung keu ntsam kelu reu gage kemauta ge teidi. Karmi napei Achan, Zerah napei Zabdi, Judah leuh gade, mateimsia kera maniadung keu ntsamkelu gade keudi, nah RAMPAUBE rata Israel napeidung reuga ruigai.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Joshua minadung de Jericho gade Ai ga langgai, cide au Bethel naimiak kepetle Beth Aven taiga. Pa penui dage ranggai, “Nghang eh hangdeu de reketlu.” Cine mina nghang eh Ai nam de reketlu. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Penui Joshua da cailigwang kecudau, penui peda ge rangdi, “Mina pelane de lang nghang so. Ai de gwa kerane mina cang na mede cang cum lang nghanglu. Cika mina peciakne de peu heta teiso, kedanemene penui au mina camlu.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Cine Israelme cang cum kenzwa ge cika nghanglu, dede Aime dwa gade penui pakdi. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Aime ne mina camrei-herok de Shebarim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tsupang bam</char></note> dwa gade kirie kecang gwamie teitsetdi, nah penuide kenghung gade teitsetdi, cine minadung helung ceu nah ngngidi.<verse eid="JOS 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Pecai Joshua pe paini hietdi. Pa nah Israel hangkiamedung penui peu gage rebui kailu delwe RAMPAUBE samkakbung dwa ga keumie tinghegi kecang bamdi. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Ciu eh Joshua rangdi, “Ah, RAMPAUBO Tinggwang, daitei minadung de peu Jordan kahpet anui de teimsia kera, Amoritme ba gage kai beuno? Magade anui Jordan lulegim lungh kecu nnung lu lie cai! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />O Rampaubo, cu au Israelme penui ngauraume dwa de nreu cailidi delu, ih dai rang lu lai no? <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Kedanemene, Canaanme nah cipau deu ga kelungme cide siulu zie nah anuide twagwalu eh anuide teitset dizie. Ciucai n zi kedi de ziemne nang daitei lai no?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Joshua dade rangdi, “Cuh lu! Nang daitei ainzwa nzu keumie lwe bam no? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Israelme kemau tei dida, nah Ih penuide aja kebeu samkakdung de gikah dida, nah teimsia kera keu ntsam pwa kebamdung gade de keu dida, nah rega nah cwa kedidung keulwe penui niadung kakga ge kai ncütdi. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Ciziemne, Israel namedung penui ngauraumedung dwaga saplu tadi. Penui ngauraume dade nreu tetdi kedanemene penui katei de teimsia dilu kera keu ntsam kedine. Ih nnuida la si lakta nnuide teimsia kebeu niadung de teimsia di mecai. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Cuh lu! Minadung de teimcilu nah penui da ranglo, ‘Ncünne ziemne nnuide teimcilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang ranggai, “Israel, nnui kak gade ma teimsia kera mania keu ntsam pwa bam. Nang aidung de keugi di kemaktane nang n ngauraume dwa gade sap gailak bam.” <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Nnui tingcang, heleuh ria gade nnui katei nnuide lia gailu. RAMPAUBE kedet kelu leuh de pautsa rehi gade gwang nna zie, pautsa gade kelak ramsang teu nna zie, kelak ramsang gade RAMPAUBE kedet lwe mipei de teu nna zie. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Mateimsia kecudung de keu kecume de mi gage ru dizie, pecu nah pegu mania kebam pelane, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE gu samkak de gikah nah pa Israel de hengam tei kedine.’”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Cine, Joshua tingcang nuge cuhlu eh Israelme de penui leuhme taiga ngngwa gwang lu, nah Judah leuh de pa ngngwa lu. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Ciu eh pa Judah pautsa de ngngwa gwang nnalu, nah pa Zerah pautsa de ngngwa lu. Pa Zerah pautsa de kilungme gade ngngwa gwang nna lu, nah pa Zabdi de ngngwa lu. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Ciu eh pa pe kilungme de ngngwa gwang nnalu, nah pa Karmi napei Achan, Zabdi napei, Zerah napei, Judah leuh gade ngngwa lu. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Ciu eh Joshua Achan dage rangdi, “A na, cu au RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang de hetwa peu, nah pe dage n maudung pet lulo. Nang daitei dibi a dage ranglo. A dade cide mbai diso.” <verse eid="JOS 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Achan Joshua de keligai, “Kesang, Ih RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang dage kemau teigai dida.” <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Shinar gade tui keludung kak gade ngaukelu hezukeyi ncwa ge, rangkanggeu shekel hai na<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu shekel hai na </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rangkanggeu kilogram kena eh si kenzwa ge.</char></note>, nah kecak kang ge perüt shekel riakngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shekel riakngei </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilogram pie ge kenzwa.</char></note>, Ih cidung de keuneu sütdi eh keulu. Cu pielo! Cidung de a ramzeuki hangdeu sum gage hebai pwa bam, rangkanggeu de pengkang ga bam.<verse eid="JOS 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Cine Joshua pe gwamedung langgai eh penui ramzeuki eh penui pakmie, nah ainie, cide pe ramzeuki gage kebai nzeu, nah rangkanggeu pekang ga bam. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Penui cide ramzeuki sum gade keulu eh Joshua nah Israel napeidung da pwagwang cidung de RAMPAUBE dwa gage ruigai. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Ge Joshua nah Israelme pecu ngngwa kela pelane Zerah napei Achan, nah rangkanggeu, nah ncwa, nah kecak kang nah pe napeimedung nah pe napuidung, nah pegu hetumseudung, pegu gada, pegu meurün, pe ramzeuki, nah peda kebam pelane pwagwang Achor langkam ga pwa gwang lu. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Ciu eh Joshua rangdi, “Daitei nang anuide teikeherei lano? Aipau nai RAMPAUBE ncu teikeherei zie.” Ciu eh Israelme pelane pecu tangtsu le sam, (tangtsu le penuide sam kedicai mi le penui de ru si dai). <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Penui pereu gage tangtsu kwa cehu sütdi cide henai kecang bamla. Cine RAMPAUBE ru kebam rata gade nreu gwanglu. Ciziemne cipau bam zi de Achor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie keherei bam</char></note> langkam lie henai kecang de qula.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Ai nam ngkapkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />RAMPAUBE Joshua dade rangdi, “Reugwame pelane de ngngwa lwe Ai ga nghanglu, ngngi so nah helungceu diso. Pielo, Ih ncu peu Ai gwangpei, nah pe minadung nah pe namdi nah pe deudung n ba gage kaibeu dida. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Nang Jericho nah pe hegwangpei de tei kegai nzwa Ai nah pe hegwangpei dage teigai zie, dede nang cika maniadung mede kauruinedung ngu tei lubui. Pecaile mbai lwe namdi gwa ketang kera nnui de mteilu.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Cine Joshua nah reugwame pelane Ai de regi kera tet cuh gai. Ge Joshua, reugwa ngkiengtumedung cang camrei de kedetlu, delwe penuide tingmui langgai. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Pa penuide aja kaigai, “Pielo, namdi caile mbai lwe penuide gwaketang luzie. Cikade tet mdei mtei so; dede nnui pelane mteiteu lalu. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Ih nah a minadung namdi ga gwang zie, nah Aime anui de renia kera pet de, anui penui dwa pak dizie keraibe pia de nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Anui penuide namdi gade ngngwa tetdi kemaktane anuide zuizie. Penui rangzie, ‘Penui ndaa keraidau anui dade pakla.’ Cine anui penui dwade pak zie. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Cipaucai anui mbai kebam gade mpet lwe namdi de tui luzie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang cide nnui ba gage peuzie. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Nnui renam gwalu de, cide mi twagai zie, RAMPAUBE pe sam kai kebeu de nzwa eh. Pielo, ih nnui de aja kaila.” <verse eid="JOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Cine Joshua penuide lang mpet gai, nah penui mbai bam ga mie, nah penui Bethel penai naimiak kenlütle Ai kakga kwabamdi. Dede Joshua cipau ziu minadung kakga bamdi.<verse eid="JOS 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Joshua tingcang nuge cuh minadung de qu hekwalu. Ciu eh pa nah Israel ga hangkiame dwa pet Ai ga nzang mie. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Reugwame pecu ngngwa kela pelane renam mna gwang tingtünle bie Ai gage ramzeuki teilu. Cika penui nah Ai kakga langkam ge bam. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Pa mina cang mengei ge de hereu gwa kerane namdi naimiak kenlütle bie Ai penai Bethel kak gage kai zeu. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Penui mina de pebam riep ga mtei nzeulu, reugwame namdi tingtünle bie kebam pelane, nah pecai kekwame namdi naimiak kenlüt lebie. Nah Joshua cipau ziu de langkam sum ga mie bamdi. <verse eid="JOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Cidau Ai gwangpei minadung de ngau luge, pa nah pe minadung zette renam gade tet pet Israelme de ngngwa regi kera kedetkelu bam gade mteilu. Dede pa pecu namdi caile de mbai kebam maa lüt pecu gwaketang kera cima. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Joshua nah Israelme pelane penui katei de peu penui dwa gade ngamlu, nah hetaideu lampui ga pak gaidi. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Ciciu eh namdi ga mina pelane de penui de zuimie kera qu hekwalu, cine penui Joshua de zuimie, ge namdi gade mdei reu reudi. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Ai ga mede Bethel ga migede Israelme cai zuimie ta kedi teima. Cine penui namdi de ngkei pwa bamdi penui Israel de zuimie kedine.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Ciciu eh RAMPAUBE Joshua dade rangdi, “N ba ga kebam hengei de Ai gage sau gai, Ih cide n ba gage kaibeu zie delu.” Cine Joshua hengei peba ga kebam de namdi gage saugai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Ge pa peba hwa gai herizi cika mbai kebammedung de cuh kwalu nah penui bam gade pak kelwa mpetdi. Penui namdi ga lüt eh cide keulu, nah renam gage mi twa zette gai. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Ge Aime nreu gwang pie, nah ainie, namdi ga mika tinggimle hang kecu ngaulu, nah penui lule ailam pak gai kera lampui gede gahdi. Kedanemene hetaideu gage tetgai kedimedung de cu nreu gwang gwaketang kelame de renia zie delu. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Joshua nah Israelme pelane mina mbai kebam namdi de tui kelu ngau, nah namdi ga mika hangdi ge, penui nreu gwang Aime de teitsetdi. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Namdi gade penuide renia kegwangme, cine penui Israelme kakga bamdi, kangge ailam nah kangge lule. Nah penuide teitsetdi, peu mi gede bang luma mede ring luma. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Penui Ai gwangpei de nring tuilwe Joshua da ngngwa gwang beudi.<verse eid="JOS 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Israelme hetaideu ga Ai namdi ga kelungme de penuide zui kemie leu de teitset cangdi ge, nah cika mina de kingtie le ngkapzingdi, ciu eh Israelme pelane Ai ga cailigwang nah cika mina pelane de teitsetdi. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Cipau nai Ai namdi ga kau kedime pelane cang kereiekena, mipei nah mipui de si eh, Aime pelane. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Kedanemene Joshua peba ga hengei de hezang pet lwe, pa Ai namdi ga kelungme de ngkap ciakdi kemaktane cide keu nghung dimah. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />RAMPAUBE ne Joshua de rangkebeu nzwa eh, Israelme namdi cika de kauruine nah maniadung rünne penui katei ziemne tuilu. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Pecai Joshua Ai rudi eh kelungta ngkapdi, henai kecang de cide cinzwa bam. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Pecai pa Ai gwangpei de tsingbang gage gwakdi tinghegi kecang. Naimiak kenlüt tingdau, Joshua pe pau tsingbang reu gade pwa nghung lwe cide namdi rieki kimui gade kelien kera aja kaibeu, nah penui cide tangtsu kekieege le kebau cimdi, cide henai de cika bam.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samkakkelu Ebal Deutu gade teiheci daikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Pecai Joshua RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang recabam ge teilu Ebal deutu ga. <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses ne Israel namedung de aja kai kebeu Moses zai laisiukwak ga rau kenzeu nzwa: “Hegeu niadung le pwa pangkemak tangtsukangdung pwa tei kelu recabam ge.” Cipau reu gage penui RAMPAUBE dage keru recadung nah kezuyi recadung ratak teigai beu. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Cika pa Moses zai tangtsudung reu gage rau dailu, ndaa Moses ne Israel namedung pelane dwa gade rau kegai de. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Israelme pelane, nah penui hangkiamedung, nah kedimedung nah penui tutiakmedung samkakbung tu kena, RAMPAUBE samkakbung pwa kela Levime nah cingkume dwa ga saplu, sangme nah deuket na, penui pempie ge Gerizim deutu dwale bamlu, nah keda pempie ge Ebal deutu dwale bamlu, Israelme de samlam beu kerane RAMPAUBE ne ndaa Moses dage ainzwa tei lulo rang kebeu nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:20">Jhn. 4:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Pecai, Joshua ne hezai pelane peigai, samlamdung nah resetdung, hezai laisiukwak ga rau pwa kela nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Moses ne Joshua dage aja kai kebeu Israel hemaabe dwade migede de peilia melie de kecu sam ge de bam ma, cika mipui, hename nah penui kakga sangme lung kebamme de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Gibeonme ne cwakedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Cu cinzwa eh hegwangpeidung pelane Jordan gwale kideutu deudi ga kebam dau, nah hangdeukehena ga, nah Mediterranean Jaaidi kung pelane ga Lebanon lebie, Hittime, Amorme, Canaanme, Perizzme, Hivitme, nah Jebusime, cide siu lu, <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />Penui Joshua nah Israelme de keregi kera ngngwa ncütlu.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Dede Gibeon ga lungkebamme Joshua ne Jericho nah Ai namdi dage teigai kecu ha siu luge, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />penui cwa kera ciem riemlu. Penui mie delwe taktyeinidung teleilu, nah rosopai hak kedidung keulu eh penui gadadung gage kailu, nah teigeuzaula hak kedidung nah hak kecube heruikup keludung, <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />nah picum hak kedibe nah kop kelube punglu, nah paini hak kedibe kailu, nah penui taktyei niadung gade tangku cangh nah sia kedibe pelane punglu. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Delwe penui Gilgal ramzeuki ga Joshua da mie peda nah Israelme dade rangdi, “Anui deudi mdei süt kecuge gade gwangla, cine cu anui kakga ngngwa samkak lugo.” <verse eid="JOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Israelme Hivitme dade rangdi, “Nnui au anui kakga kelungme au zielu. Cine dainzwa anui nnuide ngngwa samkak laino?” <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Dede penui Joshua dade rangdi, “Anui au n kilamedung.” Ge Joshua penui dade rangdi, “Nnui cau no? Nnui dai gade gwang lano?” <verse eid="JOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Cine penui pe dade rangdi, “N kilamedung deudi mdei süt kecu gade gwangla, kedanemene anui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ha, Egypt ga tei kegai leune anui siu kecu ziemne <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />nah Jordan gwale kelame Amoritme gwangpei kena dage teikegai leune, Heshbon gwangpei Sihon nah Ashtaroth ga kebam Bashan gwangpei Og. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Cine anui hangkiamedung nah anui deu ga lungh kebam leune anui dade ranggai, ‘hebeu ziemne taktyei teleilu, delwe mie penuide redau eh penui dage ranglo, “Anui nnui kilamedung. Cine anui kakga ngngwa samkak lugo.” <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Anui kilung gade ncu redau kera tetpet kecu dau, anui gu aipau tangku de lum bamreu. Iciude cu, pielo, aide cang nah pekang tei dida. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Aipau teigeuzaula anui nlipui keludung de au heci bam reu, dede pielo cidung de hak dida. Nah anui paini nah picumdung hak ciau dida anui beu tiezu kecu ziemne.’” <verse eid="JOS 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Penui taktyei cidungde luulu, dede penui RAMPAUBE lungning keteu ma. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Joshua penuide ngngwa kezuyilu, nah penuide peu penui deu ga lungh kera samkaklu, nah penui muiteumedung samkakkelu cide teimzai kera penui sampet gaibeu.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Penuide ngngwa samkak kelucai lang cumne cia, mina cidungde penui kemna penui kakga lungh kebamme lie kecu siulu. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Ciu eh lang pekecumne benai Israelme tetpet delwe penui namdidung ga cailigwang lu. Penui namdidung liecai Gibeon, nah Kephirah nah Beeroth nah Kiriath Jearim. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Dede Israelme penuide ngngwa keregi ma kedanemene penui muiteumedung RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang zi gade sampet kedine. Ngkwa kebam pelane muiteume de ncamdi. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Dede muiteumedung ngkwa kebam pelane da rangdi, “Anui RAMPAUBE Israelme Tinggwang zi teu eh penuide anui sampet mci gaibeu dida, cine cu anui penuide tei rejam daulak da. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Anui aide penui dage teigai zie: Anui penuide peu lungh zie ciude rata anui reuga gwang melu kerane kedanemene penui dage anui sampet mci beudi delu.” <verse eid="JOS 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Muiteumedung penui dage rangdi, “Peu penuide lungh lulo.” Cine penui minadung pelane ziemne tsinggetme nah dui kepwame teidi, muiteumedung penui dage rang kebeu nzwa eh.<verse eid="JOS 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Pecai Joshua penuide qu hekwa nah penui dage ranggai, “Nnui anui kakga lungbam delwe daitei nnui kemdei gade gwang lalie eh anuide cwa no? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Ciziemne cu, nnuide reset dida, nah nnui kelungta a Tinggwang ki ga kilame tei eh, nah tsinggetme nah dui kepwame tei eh lungh zie.” <verse eid="JOS 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Penui Joshua samkeligai eh rangdi, “RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang pe kilabe Moses dage aja kai eh hangdeu pelane nnuide peu zielie eh nah lungkebamme pelane de teingkap dizie lie rang mcigi kebeune, anui keringria ngkapdi kera hing eh ma aide tei dida. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Cu, ainie, anui nnui ba ga bamdida. N kecet keyi nah petau bie anuida teigai lulo.” <verse eid="JOS 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Cine pa aide teigai: Joshua ne Gibeonme de Israelme ba gade kelibeu, nah penuide teitset dimah. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Cine cipaunai Joshua penuide tsinggetme nah dui kepwame teilu, hemaabe nah RAMPAUBE recabam ziemne, pa kedet kera ni de ga, henai kecang de pa penui bata aide teila.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Tingnaimiak sapkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Jerusalem gwangpei Adoni-Zedek, Joshua dainzwa Ai nam tuilu nah teingkap zing kedi (pa Jericho nah Jericho gwangpei da tei kegai nzwa eh), nah dainzwa Israelme Gibeon ga kelungme de ngngwa kezuyi lwe penui kakga lungh bambi kecu siulu. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Penui ngngi sütdi kedanemene Gibeon nam kedi ge kecune, keda hegwangme namdidung nzwa, nah kedanemene Ai swade diki kecune, nah pe minadung reugwame ciau kecune. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Cine Jerusalem gwangpei Adoni-Zedek, Hebron gwangpei Hoham, Jarmuth gwangpei Piram, Lachish gwangpei Japhia, Eglon gwangpei Debir dage langgai eh rang, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“A da nghang eh acu nghalo. Anui Gibeon de gi go kedanemene penui Joshua nah Israelme de ngngwa kezuyi lu delu.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Cine Amoritme gwangpeidung mengei, Jerusalem gwangpei, Hebron gwangpei, Jarmuth gwangpei, Lachish gwangpei, Eglon gwangpei ngngwa ncüt lwe hang, penui nah penui reugwame pelane Gibeon dwaga ramzeuki teilu delwe penuide ngngwa keregi.<verse eid="JOS 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Gibeonme Gilgal ramzeuki ga kebam Joshua dage sam aide langgai, “Anui n kilamedung de gidi so. Kelwa gwang anuide kelibeulo, nah anuide ngha beulo, kedanemene kideutu ga lungh kebamme Amoritme gwangpeidung ngngwa ncütlwe anuide nmau bam.” <verse eid="JOS 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Cine Joshua Gilgal gade hang, pa nah reugwame pelane, nah pe reugwa yitume pelane. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />RAMPAUBE Joshua da rangdi, “Penuide hingso, kedanemene Ih penuide n ba gage peu dida. Penui kakga mi hangge de ndwa ga sap lak.” <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Tingmui pelane Gilgal gade tet eh, Joshua penui da zette gwang. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />RAMPAUBE Israelme dwa gade penuide kehebwak kaigai, nah Gibeon ga mi kekiee gede teitsetdi, nah penuide Beth Horon namdi kenghang lampui ga kecang zuimie, nah penui Azekah nah Makkedah ga kecang gi ngkaumie. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Penui Israelme dwade pak eh Beth Horon gade nghung kela dau, RAMPAUBE Tinggim gade tangheu kedi penui reu gage kelien nghung gai Azekah namdi ga kecang, nah penui tsaidi. Israelme kingtie le teitset kecu swa de tangheu gade tsai kedibe kieegwa di.<verse eid="JOS 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Israelme de Amoritme reu peu ngam kelu benai, Joshua RAMPAUBE de mpau eh Israelme dwa gade pa ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">“Tingnaimiak, Gibeon ga saplu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">nah hekei, Aijalon Langkam ga.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Tingnaimiak mtakdi nah hekei de mtakdi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">heleuhbe penui ngauraume dade hekumpeei kemaktane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 10:13">Jashar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukwak aide ndaa hereu ketei leidung Jashar ne raupwa kela kwak ge, 2 Samuel 1:18. </char></note> laisiukwak ga raupwabam meni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">Tingnaimiak tinggim sumga mtakdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">nah tingnai pelane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tingnai pelane pekie au bamdapkak kerei eh kena de de rangbam.</char></note> nghung kera kelwa tadi.<verse eid="JOS 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Cipau nai dwade nah pecai de, RAMPAUBE mina kekie teibeu kecu tingba cikenzwa gede gah. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israelme ziemne regi kecune.<verse eid="JOS 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Pecai Joshua nah Israelme pelane pecu nzang kelame Gilgal ga ramzeuki ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Hegwangpei hang mengeidung de pakmie Makkedah namdi tsupop ga mbai bam. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Joshua dage ranglia gai, hegwangpei mengeidung Makkedah ga tsupop ga mbai bam eh ngaulu dilie kecu. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Cine Joshua rangdi, “Tsupop kimui gage tangtsu kedidung kelagailu, nah cikage minadung de kwa kera kailu. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Nnui katei cika bamso. Nnui ngauraume cai gwamie penuide keregilu. Penuide peu penui namdidung ga lüt kera peu so, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang penuide nnui ba gage kaibeudi delu.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Joshua nah Israelme penuide keregi eh daptsetdi, penui tei cangdi kemaktane, nah penui ringkelume gade pak kelume riekelu namdidung ga nlütlu. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Ge mina pelane kwak eh Makkedah ga ramzeuki Joshua kebam ga cailigwang lu. Migede Israelme de kemmau sam rang tadi.<verse eid="JOS 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Ge Joshua rangdi, “Tsupop kimui ngkei lu eh hegwangpei mengei aidungde de a da ngngwa gwanglo.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Penui teilu, nah pe da hegwangme mengei de tsupop gade ngngwa gwang mpet lu, Jerusalem gwangpei, Hebron gwangpei, Jarmuth gwangpei, Lachish gwangpei nah Eglon gwangpei. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Hengwangme aidungde Joshua da ngngwa mpet luge, Joshua Israelme pelane de qu hekwalu, nah pecu ngngwa tet kedi reugwame muibedung dage rangdi, “Gwang nnalu. Hegwangme aidungde ngwang gage nnui pi cai gailu.” Cine penui gwang nnalu delwe penui pi le hengwangme ngwang cailu. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Ge Joshua penui dage rangdi, “Ngngi so nah nnui lungceu diso. Ngkieng nah kuulu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui ngauraume nnui ngngwa keregi kerame pelane dage aide teigai zie lu.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Cipau cai, Joshua penuide teitsetdi delwe tsingbang mengei gage gwakdi, nah tinghegi kecang penuide cingbang ga gwak mzeu. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Tingnaimiak nlüt kera ting dige Joshua aja kaigai, nah penuide tsingbang gade pwa nghunglu delwe penui mbai kebam tsupop gage kelien gaidi. Penui tsupop kimuide tangtsu kedidung le pwakapdi, henai kecang de aide bam.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Cine cipaunai Joshua Makkedah tuilu, nah kingtie le gidi, cika hegwangpei de si. Pa cika penuide ngkap ciakdi, nah cika kebam mina pelane de. Pa migede de bang beuma, nah pa Jericho gwangpei dage tei kegai nzwa eh Makkedah gwangpei dage de teigai.<verse eid="JOS 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngkangle Namdidung Gwakelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Pecai Joshua nah Israelme pelane de ngngwa Makkedah gade Libnah ga pet, nah Libnah de ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />RAMPAUBE aide de penui gwangpei de si eh Israelme ba gage peudi, nah cika mina pelane kebamme de kingtie le gidi. Pa migede de bang beuma, dede pa Jericho gwangpei dage tei kegai de nzwa eh Libnah gwangpei dage de teigai.<verse eid="JOS 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Pecai, Joshua nah Israelme pelane Libnah namdi gade Lachish namdi gage tetgai, nah penui ramzeuki teilu eh ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />RAMPAUBE Lachish Israelme ba gage peu, nah lang pe kenane benai pa renam cide tuilu delwe kingtie le cika lungh kebam pelane de teitsetdi, pa Libnah dage tei kegai nzwa.<verse eid="JOS 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Ge Gezer gwangpei Horam, Lachish de ngha kera gwanglu. Joshua pecu nah pe minadung de teitset ciaudi, migede de bang beuma.<verse eid="JOS 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Pecai, Joshua nah Israelme pelane Lachish gade Eglon gage tetgai. Penui cipau taiga ramzeuki teilu eh penuide ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Cipau benai penui cide tuilu delwe kingtie le cika lungh kebam pelane de teitsetdi. Cipau benai penui renam cide de ngkap zingdi, Lachish dage tei kegai nzwa eh.<verse eid="JOS 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Pecai Joshua nah Israelme pelane Eglon namdi gade Hebron gage tetgai, nah penui de ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />Penui namdi de tuilu delwe kingtie le cika hegwangpei nah namdidung pelane, nah minadung cika kebam pelane de teitsetdi. Pa migede de bang beuma, pa Eglon dage tei kegai nzwa eh, dede mina lungh kebam pelane de tei ngkap zingdi.<verse eid="JOS 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Pecai Joshua nah Israelme pecu nzang kelame Debir namdi ga cailigwang penuide ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Penui namdi cide tuilu, cika hegwangpei nah namdidung pelane, nah cika lungh kebam mina pelane de kingtie le ngkap zingdi. Nah pa migede de bang beu mah. Pa Hebron dage tei kegai nzwa eh, Debir nah cika hegwangpei nah Libnah nah cika hegwangpei dage de tei kegai nzwa.<verse eid="JOS 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Cine Joshua hangdeu pelane tuilu, nah kideutu, nah Negev deu, nah hangdeu kehenadung. Penui gwangpeidung pelane gade pa migede de bangbeu ma, keringria pelane de tei ngkap zingdi, RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang aja kai kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Joshua ne Kadesh Barnea gade Gaza namdi ga kecang, nah Goshen nam gade Gibeon nam ga kecang renam pelane tuilu. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang Israelme lam sap eh regi kebeune Joshua hegwangmedung nah penui deudung pelane tuilu. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Ge Joshua nah Israelme pelane Gilgal ga ramzeuki ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Nreule gwangpeidung de ngamkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Ge Hazor gwangpei, Jabin Israel ngkiengkelu siu luge, pa Madon gwangpei Jobab, Shimron gwangpei, nah Akshaph gwangpei da sam langgai, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />nah tingtünle kideutu ga kebam hegwangpeidung da, nah Kinnereth tingbangle Arabah, nah kehenadeudung nah naimiak kenlütle Dor hangdeu kecehudung ga <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />nah naimiak kepetle nah kenlütle Canaanme deu ga, nah Amorme nah Hittime, nah Perizzme deu ga, nah Jebusime kideutu ga, nah Mizpah deu Hermon ngkang Hivitme deu ga. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Penui nah penui reugwamedung si eh pelane penuide ngngwa mina duidi kung ga heciang kebam kenzwa kieege nah hekwen nah bagidung kekieege si eh penui mpetlu. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Aipau hegwangpeidung pelane penui kedetkelu ting gage redau lu, nah penui gwang delwe ramzeu ncüt eh Merom reuki gade Israelme de regi kera mteilu.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Joshua dade rangdi, “Penui dwa gade ngngi diso, kedanemene Ih ncünne aipau hi dau penuide Israel dwaga teitset ciak dizie. Nnui penui hekwendung pi tei telwa dizie, nah nnui penui bagidung de mi le ru dizie.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Cine Joshua nah reugwamedung pelane pecu ngngwa zette eh penuide Meromme duidung gade gwaketang, nah penui dade kaudi. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />RAMPAUBE Israelme de penui ngauraume reu ngkienglu, nah Israelme ne penuide gwaketang nah zuimie Sidon Deudi nah Misrephoth Maim ga nah naimiak kepetle Mizpah langkam kecang. Penui ngauraume pelane de teitset ciaulu kemaktane penuide keregi. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Pecai Joshua penui hekwen pi tei telwa nah penui bagidung de mi le rudi. RAMPAUBE pecu rang kebeu nzwa pa penui dage teigai.<verse eid="JOS 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Cipau tingdau Joshua cailigwang Hazor deu tuilu, nah kiengtie le hegwangpei de teitsetdi, kedanemene Hazor deu cidung hegwangram pelane peube kedine. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Penui cika mina kebam leune de kiengtie le teitsetdi, penuide teu mpet tsam eh ngkapdi kera, ring eh kebam mige de peu bang ma, nah pa Hazor namdi de mi le rudi. <verse eid="JOS 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Cine Joshua aipau namdidung gu hegwangdung peciakne nah penui hegwangpeidung peciakne tuilu, nah kiengtie le penuide teitsetdi. RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses ne aja kai kebeu nzwa pa penuide teitsetdi. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Dede namdidung pelane ziemne au Israel namdidung hangdeu penui kecehu gage tei kelubedung Hazor rünne gwale, ket de ru dima, cide Joshua ne rudi. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Israel namedung aipau namdidung ga mania pelane nah kauruinedung keulwe penui gu teilu, penui migede bang eh peu ringbam ma dede penuide teitsetdi kemaktane kingtie le penui mina leune de teitset ciakdi. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />RAMPAUBE pe kilabe Moses de ajah kai kebeu nzwa, Moses ne Joshua de aja kaibeu, nah Joshua cide mzailu. Pa RAMPAUBE ne Moses de rang kebeu magede teicang tadi kemak teima.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Joshua hangdeu aidung pelane gumlu; kideutu nah Negev pelane, nah Goshen deu pelane, nah hangdeu kehenadung, nah Arabah nah Israel kideutu, nah hangdeu kehenadung. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Halak Lamlwa gade nghang Seir kecang, Lebanon langkam ga Baal Gad gade Hermon deutu ngkangle kecang, pa penui hegwangpeidung pelane de tuilu delwe penuide teitsetdi. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Peting ketiee ge Joshua aipau gwangpeidung pelane de ngngwa regi. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Gibeon ga lungh kebam Hivitme gwale namdi ga Israel namedung de ngngwa kezuyi bam ma. Penui pelane de hereu ga penui ngngwa tetdi. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />Kedanemene cide au RAMPAUBE ne penui lung teipwa penui Israelme de ngngwa hereu tei renia kerane tei gai, ciude pa penuide ngkap zingdi lu kerane nah penuide ngau nggia mene penuide teitset ciau dilu kerane. RAMPAUBE Moses dage aja kai kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="JOS 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Cipau tingdau Joshua gwang kideutu gade Anakim de ngkapdi, Hebron gade, Debir gade, Anab gade nah Judah kideutu pelane gade, nah Israel kideutu pelane gade. Joshua penuide ngkap zingdi penui namdidung de si eh. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Anakimme migede de Israelme deu ga bang nzeu ma, Gaza, Gath, nah Ashdod ga gwale. <verse eid="JOS 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Cine Joshua hangdeu pelane tui pwa Israelme de pwaleu kera nzi beudi, RAMPAUBE ne Moses de rang kebeu de nzwa rehi gade nah heleuh rehi gade penuide nzibeu. Ge Israelme hereu ketei gade mtakdi.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Ngamkedi gwangpeidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Cu aidungde Israel namedung ne ngam kelu hegwangme deudung dida, nah Jordan keda lebie naimiak kepetle bie penui deu gum kelu, Arnon reuki gade Hermon deutu kecang nah Arabah pelane gade naimiak kepetle kecang:<verse eid="JOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Amorme gwangpei Sihon, Heshbon ga lunghdi. Pa Aroer deutu gade kedi tei, cide Arnon Gorge kung gade langkam sumga, nah Gilead deu pempie gade Jabbok Reuki ga Ammon namedung gu herai ga kecang;<verse eid="JOS 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Nah Arabah kahpet kepetle, jaaidi Kinnereth gade naimiak kepetle kecang, Arabah Jaaidi (Ketsai Jaaidi) naimiak kepetlebie, nah Beth Jeshimoth lampui si eh nah tingbangle bie, ngkangle hena nghung Pisgah deutu ga kecang;<verse eid="JOS 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Bashan gwangpei Og deu, Rephaime gu bang kenzeu, pa Ashtaroth nah Edrei ga lungh. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Hermon Deutu reu, nah Salekah renam reu, nah Bashan pelane reu kedi tei, Geshurme nah Maacahme deu rai nah Gilead pempie reu gade Heshbon gwangpei Sihon rai kecang. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses nah Israel namedung ne penuide ngamdi nah RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses ne Reubenme, Gadme nah Manasseh pempie leuhme de peu gum kera cide peudi.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Joshua nah Israel namedung Jordan reuki kahpet lwe hangdeu hegwangpeidung de ngamkelu aidung da, naimiak kenlütle bie, Lebanon langkam ga Baal Gad namdi gade Halak deutu nreule nghang Seir ga kecang. Joshua hangdeu aide Israel heleuhdung de gum kera peu penui nzi rehi gade, <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />kideutu ga, nah kehenadeudung ga nah Arabah ga nah hangdeu kehenadung ga nah hetaideu ga nah Negev deu de si eh. Hittime, Amorme, Canaanme, Perizzme, Hivitme nah Jebusime: <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Jericho gwangpei, ket; Bethel cia kebam Ai gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />Jerusalem gwangpei, ket; Enaim gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />Jarmuth gwangpei, ket; Lachish gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />Eglon gwangpei, ket; Gezer gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />Debir gwangpei, ket; Beth Geder gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />Hormah gwangpei, ket; Arad gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />Libnah gwangpei, ket; hegwangpei Adullam, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />Makkedah gwangpei, ket; Bethel gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />Tappuah gwangpei, ket; Hepher gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />Aphek gwangpei, ket; Lasharon gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />Madon gwangpei, ket; Hazor gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />Shimron Meron gwangpei, ket; Akshaph gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />Taanach gwangpei, ket; Megiddo gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />Kedesh gwangpei, ket; Carmel ga Jokneam gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />Naphoth Dor ga Dor gwangpei, ket; Gilgal ga Goyim gwangpei, ket; <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />nah Tirzah gwangpei, ket; pelane ge hegwangmedung, camrei-ket.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Kideu gwasi kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Joshua cing nah pemmi kiee süt dige RAMPAUBE pe dade rangdi, “Nang cing nah n mmi de kiee süt dida, dede cude hangdeu gumlu kera bam süt reu. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Hangdeu aidungde cude bamsi reu: Philistinme cuikui pelane, nah Geshurme deu pelane; <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />naimiak kepetle Egypt ga, Shihor gade tingtünle Ekron namdi rai kecang (cide au Canaanme deu), Philistinme gwangpeidung mengei, Gazame, nah Ashdodme, Ashkelonme, Gathme, nah Ekronme, nah Avvime <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />tingbang lebie; Canaanme deu pelane, Arah gade cide au Sidonme deu gade Aphek, Amorme rai ga kecang; <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />Gebame deu, nah kepet lebie Lebanon pelane, Baal Gad gade Hermon Deutu ngkang gade Lebo Hamath kecang. <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />Kideutu pelane ga lungh kebamme Lebanon gade Misrephoth Maim kecang, nah Sidon ga lungh kebamme pelane, Ih akatei penuide gwagi dizie Israel namedung dwa gade. Nang Israelme dage dacak tei eh hangdeu mzilu maisia, Ih ncu aja kai kebeu de nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Ciziemne, cu hangdeu aide pwa penuigu tei kera heleuhdung hekui nah Manasseh leuh pempie ziemne mzi beulu.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jordan kepetle hangdeu kemzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Keda pempie-leuh, Reuben nah Gad leuhme de si eh Moses ne peu kebeu hangdeu naimiak kepetle Jordan gwale ngaulu, RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses ne penuide kepeu nzwa: <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Arnon reuki tule lamlwa kena kakga langkie ga Aroer gade (lamlwa kakga namdi kebamde de si eh), nah Medeba kecehu langkie pelane gade Dibon ga kecang; <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />Sihon ga namdidung pelane, Amorme gwangpei, Heshbon namdi ga kedi tei kecube de, Ammon namedung rai ga kecang; <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />nah Gileadme, Geshurme nah Maacahme cuikui ga kecang nah Hermon Deutu pelane, nah Bashan pelane Salekah ga kecang; <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />Bashan ga Og hegwangram pelane, Ashtaroth nah Edrei ga kedi tei kecube, pa Rephaime bang kelume ga bamdi, Moses ne penuide ngamdi nah penuide gwa mpetdi. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Dede Israel namedung Geshurme, nah Maacahme de gwagi dima, cine cu kecang Geshur penai Maacath Israel kakga lungh bamla. <verse eid="JOS 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Moses Levi leuhme de rünne hangdeu peu ma. Penui RAMPAUBE Israelme Tinggwang da keru recadung de penui qwa pwa penui gu teidi, RAMPAUBE Moses dage rang kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Moses Reuben namedung leuh de hangdeu penui pautsa rehi gade pwapeu. <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />Penui deu au Aroer gade, cide Arnon reuki lamlwa kena kakga langkie tu ga, nah namdi cide langkam sum ga, nah Medeba cehu langkie pelane, <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />Heshbon nah cehu langkie ga kebam pelane ga namdidung, Dibon, nah Bamoth Baal, nah Beth Baal Meon, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />nah Jahaz, nah Kedemoth, nah Mephaath, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />nah Kiriathaim, nah Sibmah, nah Zereth Shahar langkam deutu ga, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />nah Beth Peor, nah hena nghung Pisgah ga, nah Beth Jeshimoth, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />nah cehu langkie namdidung pelane, nah Amorme gwangpei Sihon hegwangram pelane, Heshbon ga kedi tei kecube de, Pecu nah Midian muiteumedung de si eh Moses ne ncüt eh ngamdi, Evi, nah Rekem, nah Zur, nah Hur, nah Reba, Sihon hegwangpei nadung, cipau deu ga lungh kecume. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Israel namedung ne kiengtie le teitset kedi ga Beor napei Balaam, rekabe, teitset kedime ga si. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Reuben namedung deurai au Jordan de da. Aide au Reuben namedung penui pautsame rehi gade hangdeurai da, penui namdidung nah renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Moses ne Gad leuhme nah Gad namedung de penui pautsame rehi gade hangdeu peu; <verse eid="JOS 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Penui deu au Jazer, nah Gilead namdidung pelane nah Ammon namedung deu pempie gade naimiak kepetle Rabbah ga Aroer kecang, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />nah Heshbon gade Ramath Mizpah nah Betonim kecang, nah Mahanaim gade Debir rai kecang, <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />nah langkam ga, Beth Haram, nah Beth Nimrah, nah Succoth, nah Zaphon, nah keda Heshbon gwangpei Sihon hegwangram Jordan de herai kecu gade naimiak kepetle bie Jordan gwapet Jaaidi Kinnereth nli ga kecang. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Aide au Gad namedung de penui pautsame rehi gade pwakepeu deu, penui namdidung nah renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Moses ne Manasseh leuh-pempie de, nah cide au Manasseh namedung leuh pempie de penui pautsame rehi gade pwapeu; <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />penui deu au Mahanaim gade, Bashan pelane, Bashan gwangpei Og hegwangram pelane nah Bashan ga kebam Jair namceudung pelane namdidung riakherok; <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />nah Gilead namdi pempie, nah Ashtaroth, nah Edrei (Bashan ga Og hegwang namdidung) au Manasseh napei Machir namedung ziemne Machir namedung pempie penui pautsame rehi gade pwapeu.<verse eid="JOS 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Jordan kahpet naimiak kepetle Jericho ga Moab langkie gum kera Moses ne aidungde mzibeu. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Dede Moses Levi leuhme de hangdeu gum kera peu ma. Pa penui dage penui qwa au RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang zie, pa rangbeu kecu nzwa.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Jordan naimiak kenlütle hangdeu kenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Aipau hangdeudung de Canaanme deu Israel name ne gumkeludung da, cingkupei Eleazar, Nun napei Joshua, nah Israelme leuhdung kelak muiteume penui kak gade mzilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:19">Bat. 13:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />RAMPAUBE Moses ba gage aja kekai de nzwa, penui mapwa au dacak eh heleuh hekui nah heleuh pempie ziemne mzilu. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Moses ne Jordan gwalebie mabam heleuh kena nah heleuh pempie de pwapeu, dede pa Levime penui kakga mabam peu ma. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Kedanemene Joseph namedung heleuh kena bam, Manasseh nah Ephraim. Dede Levime de hangdeu gum kera peu ma, dede namdidung ga lungkera gwale, nah penui kauruinedung ziemne penui cehei deu de nah penui luhdung ziemne. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />RAMPAUBE Moses dage aja kaibeu, Israel namedung cide teilu, cine penui hangdeu mzilu.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hebron de Caleb de peukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Cidau Judah namedung Gilgal ga Joshua da gwang, nah Kenizzitme pei Jephunneh napei Caleb, pe da rangdi, “Kadesh Barnea gade RAMPAUBE, Tinggwang minabe Moses dade a ha nah n ha daipai rangbi nang cibam. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Ih mmi riakdai ting dau RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses, Kadesh Barnea gade reket kera acu langgai. Ih sam a mlung ga kebam de nzwa peda pung cailigwang paubeu. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Dede a sinamedung acu nzang nghang kecume ne mina mlung tei ngngidi. Dede Ih au RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang samzai teicangsiak lu. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Cine Moses cipaunai sampet gai, ‘Kesang nang tet kegai deu de, nang nah n namedung cide kelungta gumlu zie, kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang samzai tei cangsiak eh sui kelune.’ <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Cu, ainie! RAMPAUBE rang kebeu de nzwa Ih mmi riakdaiemengei dida, Israelme hetaideu ga gwang kela dau, RAMPAUBE Moses dage pe sampet kebeu de nzwa. Cu, pie gailo! Ih au henai mmi riakheset-mengei dida. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Moses ne acu lang kegai benai de nzwa henai kecang de Ih au ngkieng bamreu. Cine cu a pum yi kebam de au hereu tei kera, nah nlüt nah mpet kera ziemne kengkieng bamreu. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Ciziemne acu aide kideutu de acu peulo, cipaunai RAMPAUBE rang kebeude nzwa. Kedanemene nang de cipaunai Anakim nam de bam kecu nah rie kelu namdidung kebam de siu kecune. RAMPAUBE acu ngngwala de lubui nah Ih penuide gwampet zie, RAMPAUBE rang kebeu de nzwa.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Cine Joshua pecu samlam beu nah Jephunneh napei Caleb de Hebron de gum kera peu. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Ciziemne Hebron Kenizzitme pei Jephunneh napei Caleb gu cipaunai gade mabam peu, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang samzai tei kelune. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />(Cu Hebron namdi zi de ndaa Kiriath Arba lie qula. Pa Anakimme kakga mina kemlangme ge tei). Pecai hangdeu cide hereu ketei gade mtakdi.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Judah nzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Dacak teigai eh Judah leuhme ziemne, pautsame rehi gade, Edom deurai ngaulu, tingbangle Zin hetaideu lebie. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Penui deurai tingbangle bie au Ketsai Jaaidi kecang penli gade, duikung gade tingbangle kencwa ga. <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />Ciciu eh cide mpet tingbangle Akrabbim kideutu nah kahpet Zin hetaideu ga kecang, nah nghang tingbangle Kadesh Barnea namdi ga, nah kahpet Hezron namdi ga, nah nghang Addar namdi ga, nah Karka namdi ga mie twagwadi. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Cide Azmon kahpet, nah Egypt reuceuna ga pwa mie, nah jaaidi deurai cai penli ga cang. Aide ngu tingbangle deurai zie. <verse eid="JOS 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Naimiak kepetle deurai cai Ketsai Jaaidi da, Jordan penli ga kecang. Nah tingtünle deurai be jaaidi kung gade Jordan reu mui ga kecang. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Nah herai cide Beth Hoglah ga nghang cang, nah tingtünle Beth Arabah kahpet. Pecai herai be Reuben napei Bohan Tsukang ga nghang. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Pecai herai Achor langkam Debir gade nghang, nah tingtünle bie Gilgal nreugwang langkam tingbangle bie kebam, Adummim hangdeutu kencwa ga. Ciu eh herai En Shemesh reuki kahpet nah En Rogel gade penli cangdi. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Pecai herai nghang Ben Hinnom Langkam tingbang lebie Jebusime namdi pungcak gwang (cide cai, Jerusalem). Pecai herai nghang kideutu cide cai Hinnom langkam dwaga, naimiak kenlütle, ciciu eh Rephaim langkam tingtünle penli ga cang. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Pecai herai kaisi pet kideutu gade Nephtoah duipwak kecang, nah Ephron Deutu namdidung ga. Pecai herai Baalah twagwa bam (cide au, Kiriath Jearim), lege tet gaidi. <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Pecai herai Baalah gade nreupwa naimiak kenlütle Seir Deutu ga mie, nah Jearim Deutu tingtünle bie mie (cide cai, Kesalon), nah Beth Shemesh ga nghung, nah Timnah ga kahpet. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Pecai herai de Ekron lebie tingtünle mie. Pecai herai ngkoi pwa Shikkeron nah Baalah Deutu kahpet, nah Jabneel ga kaisi pet cang. Herai jaaidi gade penli di. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Naimiak kenlütle herai decai Jaaidi Kedi nah duikung de. Aipau herai de cai Judah namedung de twagwa, penui pautsa rehi gade.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />RAMPAUBE ne Joshua dage rang kebeu de nzwa eh, Judah leuh kakga Jephunneh napei Caleb de Judah deu gade pe qwa pwapeu, Kiriath Arba, cide cai, Hebron (Arba cai Anak pei). <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Caleb cikade Anak napei hangcum de gwa gidi: Sheshai, Ahiman nah Talmai, nah Anak pautsadung de. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Pa cikade Debir ga lungh kebamme de gwaketang kera mie (Debir zi keda Kiriath Sepher lie qula). <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Caleb rangdi, “Keheibe de Kiriath Sepher de gwaketang nah tuilu dibi, Ih a napui Aksah de pecu penau tei kera peu zie.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Kenaz napei Othniel, Caleb sinabe, tui luge, pa pe napui Aksah de penau tei kera pecu peudi. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Nah pa pe da gwang keludau, pa pecu pe pei dade luh ge kie lulo dedi. Pa pe gada gade nghung luge, Caleb pe da rangdi, “Nang dai luneu lano?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Cine pa keligai, “Acu samlam beulo, nang acu Negev deu de kepeu ne: Acu duipwakdung de si eh peulo.” Pecai Caleb pecu duipwakdung nreule nah ngkangle pwapeu.<verse eid="JOS 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Aide Judah leuhme penui pautsa rehi gade penui qwa ngau kelu deu da.<verse eid="JOS 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Namdi aidungde Judah leuhme petulebie, tingbangle Edom rai taiga: Kabzeel, nah Eder, nah Jagur, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />nah Kinah, Dimonah nah Adadah <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />nah Kedesh, nah Hazor nah Ithnan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />Ziph, Telem, nah Bealoth, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />nah Hazor Hadattah, nah Kerioth Hezron (cide au, Hazor), <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />Amam, Shema, nah Moladah, <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />nah Hazar Gaddah, Heshmon, nah Beth Pelet, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />nah Hazar Shual, Beersheba, nah Biziothiah. <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />Baalah, Iyim, nah Ezem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />Eltolad, Kesil, nah Hormah, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />Ziklag, Madmannah, nah Sansannah, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />nah Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain, nah Rimmon; pelane ge namdi ngkaie-hekui, nah penui namdidung si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Kehenadeu ga, Eshtaol, Zorah, nah Ashnah, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />nah Zanoah, nah En Gannim, Tappuah, nah Enam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Jarmuth, Adullam, Sokoh, nah Azekah, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />nah Shaaraim, nah Adithaim, nah Gederah (mede Gederothaim); namdidung kereimdai nah penui renamdung de si.<verse eid="JOS 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Zenan, nah Hadashah, nah Migdalgad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />nah Dilean, nah Mizpah, nah Joktheel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lachish, nah Bozkath, nah Eglon, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />nah Kabbon, nah Lahmas, nah Kitlish, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />nah Gederoth, Beth Dagon, nah Naamah, nah Makkedah; namdidung kereieherok, nah penui renamdung de si.<verse eid="JOS 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Libnah, nah Ether, nah Ashan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />nah Iphtah, nah Ashnah nah Nezib, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />nah keilah, nah Akzib, nah Mareshah; namdi hekui nah penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Ekron, nah namceudung nah renamdung <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />Ekron gade Jaaidi ga, Ashdod taiga kebam pelane, nah penui renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Ashdod, nah namceudung nah renamdung; Gaza, nah namceudung nah renamdung; Egypt reuceuna de nah Jaaidi Kedi nah duikung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Hangdeutu deudi Shamir ga, nah Jattir, nah Sokoh, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />nah Dannah, nah Kiriath Sannah (cide cai, Debir), <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />nah Anab, nah Eshtemoh, nah Anim, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />nah Goshen, nah Holon, nah Giloh; namdidung kereieket, nah penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Arab, nah Dumah, nah Eshan, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />nah Janim, nah Beth Tappuah, nah Aphekah, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />nah Humtah, nah Kiriath Arba (cide cai, Hebron), nah Zior: namdi hekui nah penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Maon, Carmel, nah Ziph, nah Juttah, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />nah Jezreel, nah Jokdeam, nah Zanoah, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />Kain, Gibeah, nah Timnah; namdi kerei nah penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Halhul, Beth Zur, nah Gedor, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />nah Maarath, nah Beth Anoth, nah Eltekon; namdi herok penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Kiriath Baal (cide cai, Kiriath Jearim), nah Rabbah; namdi kena nah penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Hetaideu ga: Beth Arabah, Middin nah Secacah, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />nah Nibshan, nah Ncai Namdi, nah En Gedi; namdi herok nah penui renamdung de si eh.<verse eid="JOS 15:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Dede Judah namedung Jerusalem ga lungh kebam Jebusime de gwagi luma, cine Jebusime cude cika Judahme de ngngwa lungh bamla.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Ephraim penai Manasseh de nzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Joseph leuhme de kepeu hangdeu Jericho ga Jordan gade nghang jüja, Jericho duirwak naimiak kepetle, hetaideu ga lüt, Jericho gade nghang Bethel kideutu ga. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Pecai Bethel gade cide Luz ga mie nah Ataroth ga Arkime deurai de kah gwang. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Cide Japhletme herai deu naimiak kenlüt lebie mie, Beth Horon Nkangbe herai kecang, nah cide cikade Gezer ga mie, nah jaaidi gade cangdi. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Cine Joseph, Manasseh nah Ephraim leuhme, penui mabam ngaulu.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Aide penui pautsa rehi gade, Ephraim leuhme gu herai: Penui mabam herai naimiak kepet lebie tu cai Ataroth Addar, Beth Horon Nreube ga kecang, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />nah herai jaaidi ga miecang, Mikmethath de tingtünle bam, nah pecai herai naimiak kepetle bie ge nreugai Taanath Shiloh lambie nah cide kahpwa kepet lebie Janoah ga miecang. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Pecai Janoah gade Ataroth nah Naarah ga nghung, nah Jericho gwangcang, Jordan ga mpetlu. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Pecai Tappuah gade herai naimiak kenlütle Kanah Reuceu lebie miecang. Aide Ephraim napeimedung leuhme mabam, penui pautsa rehi gade, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />Ephraim napeimedung ziemne keu ntsam kenzeu namdidung de si eh Manasseh leuhme mabam lungga kebam, namdidung nah penui renamdung pelane. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Penui Canaanme Gezer namdi ga lungh kebamdung de gwa mpet dima, cine Canaanme henai kecang de Ephraimme kakga lungh la, cine penui kemei tei eh kilame teidi.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Aipau hangdeu de Manasseh leuhme de pwapeu (kedanemene pa au Joseph neraibe), cide Gilead pei, Makir ziemne, Manasseh gu neraibe. Gilead nah Bashan de pecu peudi, kedanemene pa au reugwa keyime ge. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Pecai cika Manasseh leuhme de peudi, penui pautsa rehi gade, Abiezer leuhme de, nah Helek leuhme de, nah Asriel leuhme, nah Shechem leuhme de, nah Hepher namedung de, nah Shemida leuhme de. Aidungde Joseph napei Manasseh name mipeidung, penui pautsa rehi gade. <verse eid="JOS 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Zelophehad Hepher napei, Gilead napei, Makir napei, Manasseh napei pe na mipeina teima, dede mipuina rünne. Pe napuidung zi cai: Mahlah, nah Noah, Hoglah, Milkah, nah Tirzah. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Penui cingkupei Eleazar, nah Nun napei Joshua, nah muiteume dwaga gwang ranggai, “RAMPAUBE Moses de anui siname kakga hangdeu peu kera aja kaibeu.” Cine, Rampaube aja kai kebeu nzwa eh, pa penuide penui siname kakga hangdeu peu lu. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Zi kerei Manasseh ngaulu Gilead nah Bashan hangdeu de si eh, Jordan kebam keda lebie, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />kedanemene Manasseh napuidung pe leuhme kakga hangdeu gumlu. Gilead deu Manasseh leuh kedame de peudi.<verse eid="JOS 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Manasseh deurai de Asher gade Mikmethath kecang, Shechem namdi naimiak kepetle bie. Pecai herai cikade tingbangle En-Tappuah leuhme kebam ga kecang mie. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />(Tappuah deu de Manasseh gu, dede Tappuah, Manasseh deurai ga kebam de, Ephraim leuhme gu.) <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Pecai herai cikade reuceuna Kanah ga nghung. Reuceuna tingbangle kebam namdidung Manasseh deuceu kakga kebam de Ephraim gu. Manasseh herai de reuceuna tingtünle bie, nah Jaaidi gade penli di. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Tingbangle kebam de Ephraim gu, nah tingtünle Manasseh gu, nah jaaidi de penai deurai. Asher deurai tingtünle nah Issachar deurai naimiak kepetle. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Issachar nah Asher ga, Manasseh Beth Shan nah renamdung, nah Ibleam nah renamdung de bamsi, nah Dor nah En Dor ga lunghkebamme nah renamdung, nah Taanach nah Megiddo ga lunghkebamme nah renamdung (pekecumbe cai Napheth). <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Dede Manasseh leuhme namdi cidungde gum luma, kedanemene Canaanme hangdeu aide ga lungh kera cetkedi ziemne. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Cinzwa eh Israelme ngkieng cuh dige, penui Canaanme de penui kemei tei eh peu penui ta teidi, dede penui pelane de gwa mpet dima.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Pecai Joseph leuhme Joshua da ranggai, “Anui mina kiee sütbam, nah RAMPAUBE cu kecang anuide samlam sütbeu bam eh, daitei nang anuide hangdeu qwa ge nah zi ge rünne gumlu kera peu no?” <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Joshua penui dage rangdi, “Nnui mina kiee süt cai, Perizzme nah Rephaime deu hegung ga mie eh cika hangdeu teimci lulo, kideutu Ephraim de nnui ziemne ceuham dilu.” <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Dede Joseph leuhme rangdi, “Kideutu de anui ziemne di luma, nah hangdeu langkam ga Canaanme lungh kebam leune ga bagidung bam, Beth Shan ga nah renaamdung ga kebamdung, nah Jezreel langkam ga kelungme pelane.” <verse eid="JOS 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Cidau Joshua Joseph kilungme de resiu, Ephraim de nah Manasseh de, ranggai, “Nnui mina kiee süt nah nnui ngkieng süt. Cika nnui qwa ge rünne lak. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />Kideutu de de nnui gu zie. Cide hegung liede, nnui cide teimci nah cide nnui gu penli kecang gum luzie, kedanemene nnui Canaanme de gwa mpet dizie, penui bagidung bam, nah penui au ngkieng liede.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Kideu bangkelu kenzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Hangdeu de penui gwakelu cai Israelme pelane Shiloh namdi ga gwang ngkwalu nah cikage paiki limlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:45">Bat. 7:45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Dede Israelme kakga penui mabam ngaulu kemak leuh hena bamdi. <verse eid="JOS 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Joshua Israelme dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, nnui peime Tinggwang, nnuide kepeu deu de ga mie gum mene dai tiege mlai bam laino? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Heleuh ramsang gade mina hangcum de kedet lulo, nah Ih penuide langgai zie, nah penui mie hangdeu piezie, nah penui mahei rehi gade rau ndugai liazie, nah penui ada cailigwang daizie. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Penui cide zi hena mzi luzie. Judah tingbangle penui deu ga bamlu zie, nah Joseph kilungme tingtünle penui deu ga bam luzie. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Nang hangdeu de zi hena ndugai liazie, nah ada rau lwe cide teugwang beulu. Ih RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dwade nnui ziemne dacak tei beuzie. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Dede nnui kakga Levime penui qwa gah, kedanemene penui qwa au RAMPAUBE cingkume ta tei kerade delu. Gad, nah Reuben, nah Manasseh pempie leuh ge au penui deu ngaulu da, Jordan kahpet naimiak kepetle, RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses ne penuide kepeu.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Cine minadung cuhlu delwe miedi, nah Joshua hangdeu regum kera mie kedime dage aja kaibeu, rang eh, “Hangdeu ga mie eh cide regumlu, nah ada cailigwanglu. Ih Shiloh gade nnui ziemne RAMPAUBE dwade dacak beuzie.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Cine minadung mie nah hangdeu de kah gwanglu nah pe ha zi hena tei eh namdidung rehi gade laisiudum gage raulu. Pecai penui Shiloh ramzeuki ga Joshua da cailigwangdi. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Cidau Joshua penui ziemne Shiloh gade RAMPAUBE dwa gade dacak teibeu, nah cika de Joshua Israel namedung de hangdeu mzibeu penui nsam gade.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Benjamin namedung leuh gu dacak mpetlu penui pautsa rehi gade, nah penuide kepeu deurai de Judah nah Joseph leuhme kakga. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Penui herai tingtünle bie Jordan gade ndeu, nah Jericho tingtünle deu ga nghang cang, nah kideutu naimiak kenlütle bie de hang. Beth Aven hetaideu gade penli di. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Cikade herai Luz lebie kahpet, Luz deupia tingbangle ga mie (cide, Bethel). Pecai herai nghung Ataroth Addar ga, lamlwatu tingbangle Beth Horon kangle. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Herai naimiak kenlütle bie tu pet si nah tingbangle ge nreugai, tingbangle bie de Beth Horon de kengau ga. Herai penli be Kiriath Baal (cide, Kiriath Jearim), Judah leuhme namdi ge. Aide naimiak kenlütle bie. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Tingbangle tu herai Kiriath Jearim deutu gade ndeu, nah herai naimiak kenlütle pet si, nah Nephtoah duipwak ga miedi. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Pecai herai de nghung lamlwatu penli ga Ben Hinnom Langkam de ncwa kebam, Rephaim langkam tingtünle tu ga kebam, nah Hinnom Langkam ga nghungdi cide, Jebusime tingbangle deupia ga, nah En Rogel duilet ga nghungdi. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Pecai cide tingtünle nreudi, nah En Shemesh ga miedi, nah Geliloth <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Geliloth: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heni zi aide Gilgal qukela heni zi keda gede lubui.</char></note>ga mie, Adummim ga kenghang de ncwabam. Pecai cide Reuben napei Bohan Tsukang ga nghungdi. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Cide tingtünle Beth Arabah ga kahpet, nah Arabah ga nghung di. <verse eid="JOS 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Pecai herai Beth Hoglah tingtünle bie kahpet. Herai penli be Ketsai Jaaidi tingtünle bie kungga, tingbangle Jordan penli ga. Aide tingbangle deurai. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Jordan de kepetle tu herai. Aide Benjamin leuhme qwa, twagwa kebam pelane deurai rehi gade, penui pautsa rehi gade.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Benjamin namedung leuh namdidung, penui pautsa rehi gade cai: Jericho, nah Beth Hoglah, nah Emek Keziz, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />nah Beth Arabah, nah Zemaraim, nah Bethel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />nah Avvim, nah Parah, nah Ophrah, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />nah Kephar Ammoni, nah Ophni, nah Geba; namdidung kereiekena nah penui renamdung. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Gibeon, nah Ramah, nah Beeroth, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />nah Mizpah, nah Kephirah, nah Mozah, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />nah Rekem, nah Irpeel, nah Taralah, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />nah Zelah, Haeleph, nah Jebus (cide, Jerusalem), Gibeah, nah Kiriath; namdidung kereiemdai nah penui renamdung. Aide au Benjamin leuhme gu mabam penui pautsa rehi gade.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Simeon ziemne mzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Dacak kenabe Simeon da mpetlu, Simeon namedung leuh ziemne penui pautsa rehi gade. Penui gumkelu deu de au Judah leuhme ne gumkelu deu sum ga bam. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Penui magum ngaukelu deu cai Beersheba, nah Sheba, nah Moladah, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />nah Hazar Shual, nah Balah, nah Ezem, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />nah Eltolad, nah Bethul, nah Hormah, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />nah Ziklag, nah Beth Markaboth, nah Hazar Susah, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />nah Beth Lebaoth, nah Sharuhen; namdidung kereiekecum nah penui renamdung. <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Ain, Rimmon, nah Ether, nah Ashan; namdidung mdai nah penui renamdung, <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />nah renamdung pelane namdidung aidungde de twagwa kebam Baalath Beer (Negev ga Ramah) ga kecang. Penui pautsa rehi gade, aide Simeon leuhme qwa da. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Simeon leuhme qwa Judah namedung gumkebam deu ga bam, kedanemene Judah namedung deu be penui ziemne dizu kedine, cine Simeon namedung penui deu sum ga gumlu.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zebulun ziemne nzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Dacak pe kecumbe Zebulun leuhme da mpetlu, penui pautsa rehi gade. Penui gumkelu herai Sarid ga kecang mie cang. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Penui herai naimiak kenlütle bie Maralah lambie nghang, nah Dabbesheth ga mie cang nah reuceuna Jokneam kengau ga mie cang. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Pecai naimiak kepetle ge nreugai Sarid gade naimiak kepetlebie ge Kisloth Tabor herai ga. Pecai Daberath ga mie nah Japhia ga nghang cang. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Cide cikade naimiak kepetle bie kahpet Gath Hepher nah Eth Kazin ga, nah Rimmon ga mie, nah Neah lambie nreugai. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Pecai herai tingbangle Hannathon lege nreugai, nah Iphtah El langkam gade penli di. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Kattath, nah Nahalal, nah Shimron, nah Idalah, nah Bethlehem de ncüt si: namdidung kereiekena nah penui renamdung. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Penui pautsa rehi gade, aide cai Zebulun leuhme qwa, aipau namdidung nah penui renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Issachar ziemne nzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Dacak pe mdaibe Issachar da gwanglu, Issachar leuhme da, penui pautsa rehi gade. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Penui deudung au Jezreel, nah Chesulloth, nah Shunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />nah Hapharaim, nah Shion, nah Anaharath, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />nah Rabbith, nah Kishion, nah Ebez, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />nah Remeth, nah En Gannim, nah En Haddah, nah Beth Pazzez. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Herai de Tabor, nah Shahazumah, nah Beth Shemesh ga mie cang, Jordan gade penui herai penli di; namdidung kereieherok nah penui renamdung. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Aide Issachar namedung leuhme qwa, penui pautsa rehi gade, penui namdidung nah penui renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asher ziemne nzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Dacak pe mengeibe Asher namedung leuhme da gwanglu, penui pautsa rehi gade. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Penui deudung au Helkath, nah Hali, nah Beten, nah Akshaph, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />nah Allammelek, nah Amad, nah Mishal, nah Carmel naimiak kenlütle nah Shihor Libnath ga miecang. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Pecai cide naimiak kepetle Beth Dagon lambie nreugai nah Zebulun, Iphtah El Langkam, tingtünle bie Beth Emek, nah Neiel ga mie cang. Pecai cide Kabul lambie tingtünle mie jüja di, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />nah Abdon, nah Rehob, nah Hammon, nah Kanah, Sidon Kedi ga kecang. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Herai Ramah lam ge nreu caili, nah pecaide Tyre riekelu namdi ga. Pecai herai Hosah ga nreu gaidi, nah Akzib cuikui jaaidi gade penli di, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />nah Ummah, nah Aphek, nah Rehob; namdidung ngkai-kena nah penui renamdung. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Aide Asher namedung leuhme qwa, penui pautsa rehi gade, namdidung aidungde nah penui renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naphtali ziemne mzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Dacak pe herokbe Naphtali namedung da gwanglu, penui pautsa rehi gade. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Penui deudung au Heleph gade, Zaanannim ga mhu bang gade, nah Adami Nekeb lebie, nah Jabneel, Lakkum ga kecang, nah Jordan gade penli di. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Herai be naimiak kenlütle nreugai Aznoth Tabor lege nah Hukkok lambie miedi; tingbangle Zebulun ga mie cang, nah naimiak kenlütle Asher nah Judah ga, Jordan taiga naimiak kepetle mie cang. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Riekelu namdi cai Ziddim, Zer, nah Hammath, Rakkath, nah Kinnereth, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />nah Adamah, nah Ramah, nah Hazor, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />nah Kedesh, nah Edrei, nah En Hazor, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />nah Yiron, nah Migdal El, Horem, nah Beth Anath nah Beth Shemesh: namdidung kereiehekui nah penui renamdung. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Aide Naphtali namedung leuhme magum, penui pautsa rehi gade, namdidung nah penui renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dan ziemne nzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Dacak pe henabe Dan namedung leuh da mpetlu, penui pautsa rehi gade. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Penui deu herai cai, Zorah, nah Eshtaol, nah Ir Shemesh, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />nah Shaalabbin, nah Aijalon, nah Ithlah, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />nah Elon, nah Timnah, nah Ekron, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />nah Eltekeh, nah Gibbethon, nah Baalath, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />nah Jehud, nah Bene Berak, nah Gath Rimmon, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />nah Me Jarkon, nah Rakkon, Joppa tai kebam deurai de si. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Dan leuhme penui deurai tei nggahdi ge, Dan leuhme Lashem mede regi kera mie, nah penuide tuilu nah kiengtie le teitsetdi. Penui cide gumlu nah cika lunghdi nah Lashem Dan de qulu, penui pei Dan zi leu eh. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Aide Dan namedung leuh qwa, penui pautsa rehi gade, namdidung aidungde nah penui renamdung.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Joshua ziemne mzikebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Penui hangdeu penui herai rehi gade mzi cang luge, Israelme Nun napei Joshua de hangdeu gumkera pwa peu. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />RAMPAUBE ne rangkebeu nzwa penui pa kie kecu namdi de pecu peu, kideutu deudi Ephraim ga Timnath Serah de. Pa namdi de tei cuhlwe cika lunghdi.<verse eid="JOS 19:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Cingkupei Eleazar, Nun napei Joshua, nah Israel leuh peime peuteu medung Shiloh gade dacak eh mzikelu qwa da, RAMPAUBE dwa, paiki kimui gade. Iciu eh penui hangdeu mzi cang lu.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Kemsiu namdidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Joshua da ranggai, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Israelme de mpau lulo, rang eh, ‘Kensiu namdidung kedetlu n katei nziemne, Ih Moses dade ndage rang kebeu de. <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />Mige cimene mide teitset nah matei mau dicai cika ge pakgai lubui, nah penui hekum peei kelame dade cika nsiu luzie. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Pa namdidung ket gage pak gaidi zie nah namdi rieki kimui dwa ga saplu zie nah pa tei kedibe ha namdi ga hangkiamedung da ge rang zie. Pecai penui pecu namdi ga ngngwa nlütlu zie nah pecu penui kakga lungh kera ni ge peuzie. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Pe kum peei kelame magade pecu peei gwang cai, penui teiketsetbe de penui ba gage kaibeu lak, kedanemene pa pe kidabe de pedwa ngkau bam ma, dede teimau eh teitsetdi dilu. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Hemaabe dwa hetutiak kerane saplu kemaktane pa namdi ga bamzie, cipau tingdau cingkupei kedibe tsaidi kemaktane. Pecai mide teiketsetbe caili luzie nah pekatei pe namdi nah pekatei peki ga gwang luzie, pa pak kedi namdi ga.’”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Cine penui Kedesh de Galilee ga Naphtali kideutu deudi ga, nah Ephraim kideutu deudi ga Shechem, nah Judah kideutu deudi ga Kiriath Arba (cide au, Hebron) de teimcilu. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Jordan gwale Jericho naimiak kepetle, langkie hetaideu ga, penui Reuben leuhme dade Bezer kedet lu, nah Gad leuhme dade, Gilead ga Ramoth, nah Manasseh leuhme dade, Basan ga Golan. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Aipau namdidung Israel namedung pelane nah sangme penui kakga lungh kebamme ziemne kedetlu, iciu eh keheibe de ci mene mide teitset kedime cikage pakgai luzie nah hekum peei kelame ba gade tsai dilak hemaabe dwa saplu kemaktane.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Levime ziemne renamdung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Pecai Levime peime reu muiteume cingkupei Eleazar da gwang, nah Nun napei Joshua, nah Israelme leuhdung peu keteume da gwang <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />Canaan deu Shiloh gade penuide mpau eh ranggai, “RAMPAUBE Moses ba gage aja kaibeu anuide peu namdidung ga lungh kerane nah anui gu kauruine ziemne ceheideudung anuide peu.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Cine RAMPAUBE sampet gade namdi aidungde Israelme penui deudung gade nah penui ceheideudung Levime de pwapeu.<verse eid="JOS 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Kohath pautsame kakde dacak mpetlu. Nah dacak rehi gade namdidung kereiekecum Judah leuh gade, nah Simeon leuh gade nah Benjamin leuhme deu gade cingkupei Aaron (Levime gade) leuhme ziemne dacak peu bam.<verse eid="JOS 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Kohath leuhme kebangbe de dacak namdidung kerei Ephraim pautsa leuh gade, nah Dan leuh gade nah Manasseh pempie leuhme deu gade peu.<verse eid="JOS 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Pecai Gershon leuhme de namdidung kereiekecum Issachar pautsa leuh gade, nah Asher leuh gade, nah Naphtali leuh gade, nah Bashan ga Manasseh pempie leuh gade dacak peu.<verse eid="JOS 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Merari leuhme penui pautsa rehi gade namdidung kereiekena Reuben leuhme gade, nah Gad leuhme gade, nah Zebulun leuhme gade peu.<verse eid="JOS 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Cine RAMPAUBE Moses ba gage aja kai kebeu nzwa Israelme dacak eh namdi aidungde nah penui ceheideudung si eh Levime de pwapeu. <verse eid="JOS 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Judah leuhme gade nah Simeon leuh dade, penui leuh rehi zi gade namdi aidungde de mzibeu. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Penui au Aaron leuhme ziemne, Kohath pautsa gade kebamme, Levi leuhme. Dacak raitube penui da gwang. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Penui penuide Kiriath Arba, Anak pei de peu (cide cai Hebron), Judah ga kideutu deudi nah petai twagwapung kebam ceheideudung de si eh. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Dede namdi luhdung, nah cipau renamdung de, penui Jephunneh napei Caleb de pe mabam tei kera peudi.<verse eid="JOS 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Cingkupei Aaron leuhme de penui Hebron pwapeu (mide teitset kedime keheibe de kensiu namdi ge) nah pe ceheideudung, nah Libnah pe ceheideudung, <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Jattir nah pe ceheideudung, nah Eshtemoa pe ceheideudung. <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Holon nah pe ceheideudung, Debir nah pe ceheideudung, <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />nah Ain pe ceheideudung, Juttah nah pe ceheideudung, nah Beth Shemesh pe ceheideudung; heleuh aikena dade namdidung hekui. <verse eid="JOS 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Benjamin leuhme gade Gibeon pe ceheideudung, Geba pe ceheideudung de peudi. <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />Anathoth pe ceheideudung nah Almon pe ceheideudung; namdidung mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Aaron leuhme cingkume namdidung pelane ge kereiekecum penui ceheideudung si eh.<verse eid="JOS 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Kohath pautsa kelakdung, Levime kebangbe Kohath leuh gade, Ephraim leuhme dade penui deu namdidung penui ngaulu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Penui penuide Shechem peu (mide teiketsetme keheibe de kensiu namdi ge) nah pe ceheideudung Ephraim ga kideutu deudi, nah Gezer pe ceheideudung peu. <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />Nah Kibzaim pe ceheideudung, nah Beth Horon pe ceheideudung, namdidung mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Dan leuhme dade cai Eltekeh pe ceheideudung, nah Gibbethon pe ceheideudung, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />nah Aijalon pe ceheideudung, nah Gath Rimmon pe ceheideudung-namdi mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Manasseh leuh pempie dade namdidung kena peu, Taanach pe ceheideudung, nah Gath Rimmon pe ceheideudung. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Kohath leuhme pautsa kebangbe ziemne namdidung kerei pelane penui ceheideudung de si eh peulu.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Manasseh leuh pempie gade Levime pautsa Gershon leuhme de namdi aidungde peu, Golan Bashan ga (mide teiketsetme keheibe de kensiu namdi ge) pe ceheideudung nah Be Eshterah pe ceheideudung-namdidung kena. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Issachar leuhme dade cai Kishion pe ceheideudung, nah Daberath pe ceheideudung. <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />Jarmuth pe ceheideudung, nah En Gannim pe ceheideudung-namdidung mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Asher leuhme dade cai Mishal pe ceheideudung, nah Abdon pe ceheideudung, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />Helkath pe ceheideudung, nah Rehob pe ceheideudung-namdi mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Naphtali leuhme dade namdi kecum peu, Kedesh Galilee ga (mide teiketsetme keheibe de kensiu namdi ge) nah pe ceheideudung, nah Hammoth Dor pe ceheideudung, nah Kartan pe ceheideudung. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Gershonme pautsa namdidung pelane ge namdidung kereiekecum penui ceheideudung si eh.<verse eid="JOS 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Merari leuhme pautsa Levime kebangbe, Zebulun leuhme dade cai Jokneam pe ceheideudung, Kartah pe ceheideudung, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />Dimnah pe ceheideudung, nah Nahalal pe ceheideudung, namdidung mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Reuben leuhme dade au Bezer pe ceheideudung, nah Jahaz pe ceheideudung, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />Kedemoth pe ceheideudung, nah Mephaath pe ceheideudung, namdidung mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Gad leuhme dade Gilead ga Ramoth (mide teiketsetme keheibe de kensiu namdi ge) nah pe ceheideudung, nah Mahanaim pe ceheideudung de si eh, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />Heshbon pe ceheideudung, nah Jazer pe ceheideudung, pelane ge namdidung mdai. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Penui pautsa rehi gade Merari leuhme namdidung pelane, nah Levime pautsa kebangbe, dacak eh namdi kereiekena.<verse eid="JOS 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Israelme ne gum kelu hangdeu Levime namdidung pelane ge namdidung riakdai-heset, penui ceheideudung si eh. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Namdi aidungde, namdi ge cai namdi ge ceheideudung ne penuide twagwa pung bam. Cine cide au namdi aidungde pelane de ai nzwa.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Cine RAMPAUBE Israelme de pa penui paume dage hangdeu peu zielie pe sampet kebeu nzwa eh pwa penuide peu, nah penui hangdeu cidungde gumlu eh cika lunghdi. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Ge RAMPAUBE maleune gade kemtak penuide peu, pa penui paume dage pe sampet kebeu pelane rehi gade, nah penui ngauraume pelane gade migede penuide renia eh sap ma. RAMPAUBE penui ngauraume pelane de penui ba gage peudi. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />RAMPAUBE Israelme dage ma keyi leune gade pe sampet kaikebeu kette teicang mene tadi ma; cide pelane teigwang canglu.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Tingnaimiak kepetle bieme kilung cailikegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Cipau tingdau Joshua, Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh pempie leuhmedung de qulu. <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />Nah penui dage rangdi, “Moses RAMPAUBE kilame aja kaigai kebeu pelane nnui tei luda, nah a sam kai kebeu leune ajadung nnui mzai luda. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Nang aipau tingbadung dega nang n siname de pütdi meda, nah nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang sam kai kebeudung kainzeu luda. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Cu au RAMPAUBE nnui siname de kemtak peu dida, penuide rang kebeude nzwa. Cu, ciziemne, nreu eh nnui ramzeuki ga gwang cu, nnui gum kelu deu, Moses RAMPAUBE kilabe ha kebeu Jordan deu ga.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:8">Heb. 4:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Dede Moses RAMPAUBE kila aja kekai hezaidung nnui mzai sünne lu; RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de ku eh pe lampui ga tet nah hezai kai kebeudung de mzai nah pecu ngngei eh bamlu nah n mlung nah n keringria pekiene teu pe gwa teilu.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Ge Joshua penui de samlam gaibeu eh, penui lang gaidi nah penui ramzeuki ga miedi.<verse eid="JOS 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />(Cu Manasseh leuh pempie de Bashan ga Moses ne maabam peu, dede keda pempie de Joshua ne Jordan naimiak kenlütle penui siname kakga maabam peu) penuide samlam gai eh penui ramzeuki gage langgai di <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />nah penuide rang eh, “Mahei kekiee teu nnui ramzeuki ga cailigwanglu, kauruine kekiee ge, rangkanggeu, kecak, hetageu, hegeu nah painiadung kekie ge. Nnui ngauraume dade ngau kelude nnui siname dage nzilu.” <verse eid="JOS 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Cine Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh leuh pempie namedung, Israel namedung da de nreudi nah Shiloh gade tetpet di, Canaan deu ga, Gileadme deu ga tetgai kerane, penui gumkelu deu ga, Moses dage RAMPAUBE ne rangkebeu deu ga.<verse eid="JOS 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Penui Jordan cuikui Canaanme deu ga gwang keludau, Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh leuh pempie namedung cika recabam ge Jordan Reuki kung ga teilu, recabam keyi kedi ge. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Cu Israel namedung cide siu luge rangdi, “Ainie! Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh leuh pempie namedung Canaanme deu dwaga recabam ge teilu, Geliloth ga Jordan taiga, Israel namedung lambie ge.” <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Israel namedung cide siu luge, penui ngkwa kebam hereu ga mie regi kerane pelane Shiloh ga ngkwa ncütlu.<verse eid="JOS 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Ge Israel namedung samgwame de Gileadme deu ga, Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh leuh pempie namedung dage, cingkupei Eleazar napei Phinehas de langgai, <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />nah pecu muiteume hangkerei ngngwalwe, Israel leuhme pelane gade hangge ge ngngwa la, nah penui pelane de penui pautsa gade peuketeu medung. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Nah penui Gileadme deu ga Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh leuh pempie namedung da gwanglu, nah penui dage ranggai, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />RAMPAUBE mina pelane maa aide rangzeu, “Nnui Israel Tinggwang zaidung gileu kedi, nah RAMPAUBE caisui ketei gade nreutet lwe RAMPAUBE de renia eh nah nnui katei nnui recabam tei kecu aide dai no? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Peor lamlwa ga kemau tei kedide anui ziemne ceuzu ni? Henai kecangde cipaude gade anuide tei mcilu mereu. Cide RAMPAUBE mina maabe da keherei teugwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:5-9">Pum. 25:5-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Nang henai RAMPAUBE caisui ketei gade nreutet kedi tei dida, nah ainzwa zie nang henai RAMPAUBE de renia lacai, pa ncünne Israel mina maadung de pe rata dizie. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Cu magade nnui gum kelu deu de teihera dicai, RAMPAUBE gumkelu deu ga kahgwanglu anui kakga, dede RAMPAUBE de renia so, mede anuide renia eh nnuikatei nnui recabam teiso, anui RAMPAUBE Tinggwang recabam gwale. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Zerah napei Achan hemaa ngkapdi kera keustam pwa kebam ga masanglu melui ni? Cine lunghop Israelme pelane reu gwangdi, nah pe mau ziemne pa rünne tsai ma.”<verse eid="JOS 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Pecai Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh leuh pempie namedung Israel pautsa peuteume dage rangdi; <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Kengkieng kedibe, Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE! Kengkieng kedibe, Tinggwang, RAMPAUBE! Pa ci la, nah Israel de de peu cilu! Magade anui RAMPAUBE de renia nah cwa cai, henai anuide ketsai gage kai dilu. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Anui magade anui katei recabam tei lwe RAMPAUBE dade nreutet dicai, mede magade cipau recabam gage keru recadung, mei recadung mede kezuyi recadung tei gai cai, peu RAMPAUBE de anuide saja peu lu. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Ma! Anui kehing le aide teilu, rang eh gwang daikela tingdau n namedung a namedung da rang lubui, ‘Nnui RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang de ngngwa daitei kera bamno? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE anui kakga Jordan le herai teidi, Reuben nah Gad namedung kakga. RAMPAUBE de nnui ngngwa magede tei kera gah.’ Iciude nnui leuhme a leuhme de peu RAMPAUBE de hing tadi lu kerane. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Cine anui rangdi, ‘Anui katei anui gu recabam ge tei luzie, keru recadung nah ratak ziemne mene, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />dede cide anui nah nnui kakga zierang ge zie, nah anui ceheu caileu kerame kakga, ciu eh anui RAMPAUBE dwa ga heta teigai kera, anui gu keru recadung nah anui gu ratakdung, nah anui gu kezuyi recadung teu eh, iciude nnui gwangdai kera ting ga nnui namedung anui namedung dage, “RAMPAUBE da nnui qwa gah,”’ de eh rang melu kerane. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Cine anui rangdi, ‘Magade anuide mede anui ceheu gwangdai kera mede aide rangcai, anui rang lubui, “Ainie! RAMPAUBE recabam kenzwabe anui peimedung ne ketei de, keru recadung nah ratak ziemne ma, dede anui kakga nah nnui kakga zierang teilu kerane.” <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Madaude gede anuide peu RAMPAUBE de renia diso, nah RAMPAUBE caisui ketei gade nreutet lwe keru recadung, meiciu recadung nah ratakdung ziemne recabam gede tei dilak RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang recabam gwale.’”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Cu cingkupei Phinehas nah muiteumedung nah Israelme pautsa hepeuketeumedung, pecu Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh namedung kerang de siulu, ge penui cide penui suilu. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Cine cingkupei Eleazar napei Phinehas, Reuben, Gad nah Manasseh namedung dage rangdi, “Henai anui RAMPAUBE bam lie kecu ciluda, kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE de cwa kecu ta teidi meda. Cu nang Israel namedung de RAMPAUBE ba gade keli luda.” <verse eid="JOS 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Pecai cingkupei Eleazar napei Phinehas nah muiteumedung Gileadme deu ga Reuben nah Gad namedung dade Canaan deu ga, Israelme da cailigwanglu, nah penuide sam teu cailigwang beu. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Penui sam pau kebeude Israel namedung penui suilu, cine Israel namedung Tinggwang de hetwa peu, nah Reuben nah Gad namedung de ngngwa hereu tei kera rangsi tadi. <verse eid="JOS 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Cine Reuben nah Gad namedung recabam de, “Zierang” de qulu, kedanemene cide penui rangdi, “aide anui kakga RAMPAUBE au Tinggwang lie kecu zierang da.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Muiteume dage Joshua sam kekambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Peting ketieege caine, RAMPAUBE Israelme de penui ngauraume pelane penuide twagwa kebamme dade kemtak peu, nah Joshua hecing sütdi. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Cine Joshua Israelme pelane de qu hekwalu, hangkiame, muiteume, tutiakme, nah kedime, nah pa penui da rangdi, “Ih cu au hecing süt dida nah a mmi kekiee ge dida. <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui ziemne heleuh aidungde pelane dage tei kegai leune nnui ngauda, kedanemene nnui ziemne regi kebeube au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang delu. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Ainie! Ih nnuide heleuh aidung de de nnui leuhme deu lu kerane pwapeu da, Jordan gade, nah Ih ngamkelu heleuh pelane, naimiak kenlütle Jaaidi Kedi kecang de. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, pa penuide nnui dwade gwagi dizie nah penuide nnui dwade keugi dizie, nah nnui penui deu gum luzie, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Cine sap ntiplu, iciude nnui Moses zai laisiukwak ga rau kenzeudung tei mzai lu kerane, cide gade zetle ba mede hile ge nreugai di melu kerane, <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />ciude nnui heleuhdung nnui kakga bang kebamme de ngngwa kangbau melu kerane, mede penui rabedung zi rang, mede penui zi teu eh sampet tei, penui gwatei mede keumie penuide reca melu kerane. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Meliene, nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de ngngeilu, nnui henai kecang teikela nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui dwade heleuh kedi nah kengkiengdung de gwa mpet dida. Nah henai kecang migede nnuide renia eh sap luma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:45">Bat. 7:45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Nnui mipei hangge ne mina cang ge de gwagi dizie, kedanemene RAMPAUBE au nnui Tinggwang lu. Pa nnui ziemne regibeu kelabe da, pa nnui dage rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Ciziemne, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hung kera nnui laikai tei lulo. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Dede magade nnui nreu caili nah bang leuh aide de ncüt cai, nnui kakga kebam heleuh, nah penuide ngngwa keleilüt, nah nnui penui kakga mie nah penui nnui kakga gwang cai, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />iciucai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang heleuh aidungde de nnui kak gade keu nzia dilak lie kecu ci mci lulo, dede penui nnui ziemne hebaih ge nah hetak ge dizie, nah nnui miak ga hetudung nzwa zie, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide hangdeu keyi kepeu gade nnui gahdi kemaktane.<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />Cu ainie, henai Ih kideu pelane gade tetdi lauda, nah nnui mlung pelane le cibam RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui ziemne rang kegai keyidung leune sam gede teicang mene tadi mah. Nziemne peciakne de teicang beu, sam gede teicang mene tadi ma. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang sam keyi leune nnui da kerang de teicang gwang kelu nzwa eh, cinzwa eh RAMPAUBE nnui reu gage ma kesia leu teigai zie nnuide ngkapdi kemaktane RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kepeu hangdeu keyi de gade. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang samkakkelu de, pa ne ajah kai kebeu de tei mzailu mene, nah mie delwe hera keda gwatei nah keumie penuide reca cai, RAMPAUBE rata nnuida gwang zie, nah nnui zette gah dizie nnuide kepeu hangdeu keyide gade.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Samkakkelu de teiheci daikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Ge Joshua Shechem gage Israel leuhme pelane de qu hekwalu Israel hecing hangkiame, muiteume, tutiakme nah kedime de, delwe penui Tinggwang dwaga gwang. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Joshua mina pelane da rangdi, “RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang ainzwa rangla, ‘Ndaa nnui paume tingdau Euphrate Reuki lule gim lungh, Abraham pei Terah nah Nahor pei, penui hera kedabe de reca la. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Dede Ih nnui pei Abraham de Euphrate Reuki lule gim de ngngwa lu, delwe pecu peu Canaanme deu pelane kahgwang, nah pe leuh tei ngkiee beu, delwe pecu Isaac peu. <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />Cipaucai Isaac de Ih Jacob nah Esau peu. Ih Esau de Seir hangdeutu namdidung gum kera peu, dede Jacob nah pe leuhme Egypt ga nghungdi. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Cipaucai Ih Moses nah Aaron de langgai eh Ih Egyptme de teikeherei. Pecai ih nnuide ngngwa mpet beu. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Pecai Ih nnui paume de Egypt gade ngngwa mpet beu nah nnui Jaaidi ga gwang Egyptme nnui peime de bagidung nah hekwen keteume Jaaidi Kegie ga gwamie. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Cine penui RAMPAUBE da hap eh kie, ge Pa nnui nah Egyptme kakga kemui kaidi, pa jaaidi teugwang penui reu gage kailwe gumdi. Nnui miakle ngauda Ih Egyptme da dai teigai dibi. Delwe nnui hetaideu ga peting kekiee ge lung. <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Ih nnuide Amoritme deu ga ngngwa gwang, Jordan reukung kedale lungh kebamme da. Penui nnuide regi nah Ih penuide nnui ba gage kaibeu, nah nnui penui deu de gum luda, nah nnui dwade Ih penui de teimsia dida. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Ge Zippor napei Balak, Moabme gwangpei, cuh lwe Israelme de ngngwa regi. Pa Beor napei Balaam de kugai nah langgai, nnuide reset kera. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Dede Ih Balaam kwa kingnei ma, cine pa nnuide samlam beu, nah pe ba gade nnuide kelibeu. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Delwe penui Jordan kahpet lwe Jericho namdi ga gwang, nah Jericho minadung nah Amoritme, nah Perizzme, nah Canaanme, nah Hittime, nah Girgashme, nah Hivitme nah Jebusime nnuide ngngwa regi, dede Ih penuide nnui baga kaibeu. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Ih nnui dwaga kuidi langgai, nah cidungde ne nnui dwa gade penuide gwa mpetdi Amoritme hegwangme kena nnui kingtie nah nnui lakpidung le au ma. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Ih nnuide rei mezing eh hangdeu aide peu nah namdidung nnui ne tei ma dede nnui cika lung. Kubetsi nah olive tsidung nnui linggai kemak bang gade nnui tyei bam.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Cine cu au RAMPAUBE mie hinglu nah nnui lungsang pelane teu peta teilu, nnui peime Egypt ga Kereuki gwale hera keda reca kelade gidi eh RAMPAUBE gwa teilu. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Dede nnui miak gade magade RAMPAUBE gwatei neumai, nnui katei nnui caube gwatei ziebi kedetlu, ndaa nnui paume Euphrate Kereuki gwale reca kela rabedung de ziemi nnui lung kebam deu ga Amoritme rabe de ziebi. Dede Ih nah a kilungme au RAMPAUBE gwa teizie.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Pecai minadung sam keli eh rangdi, “Anui RAMPAUBE de pütdi eh hera keda ge de reca kera au lakzing, <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />kedanemene RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang ne anui nah anui peime de Egyptme deu gade teu ncuh beu, hebaang ketei ki gade, nah mimakecang bata anui lambie ge tei gai, anui tet kela lampui leu ga anui de gum beu, nah mina leune kakga anui kahgwang kecudau de. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />RAMPAUBE mina hangdeu aika lungh kebam leune de gwa mpet beu anui dwa gade, Amoritme de si eh. Cine anui de RAMPAUBE gwa tei zie kedanemene pa anui Tinggwang.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:45">Bat. 7:45</ref></char></note><verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Dede Joshua minadung da rang eh, “Nnui RAMPAUBE gwa tei gailak de cilak, kedanemene Pa au kemci Tinggwang; Pa au periakketei Tinggwang. Pa au nnui hezaidung gikah kedi nah nnui kemau tei kedi de nnui mau gilak. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Nnui magade RAMPAUBE de pütdi eh hera kedade reca ladicai, pa nreu gwang nnuide rezam dizie nah nnuide teimsia dizie nah pa nnui da makeyibe tei kebeu caine.” <verse eid="JOS 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Dede minadung Joshua da rangdi, “Lak anui RAMPAUBE gwa teizie.” <verse eid="JOS 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Ge Joshua minadung da rangdi, “Nnui RAMPAUBE de kedetlu delie nah pe gwa teizie lie de eh nnui katei nnui zierang teizie.” Penui rangdi, “Anuide zierangme da.” <verse eid="JOS 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />“Ciziemne cu, nnui kakga sangme rabe kebamdung de keugi dilu, nah nnui mlung RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang da nreu gailu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Ge minadung Joshua da rangdi, “Anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang gwa teizie nah anui pe kwa kingnei zie.” <verse eid="JOS 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Joshua cipaunai minadung de ngngwa samkaklu, nah Shechem ga penui ziemne hezai ge nah hetuketiak ge teibeu. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Joshua aipau samde Tinggwang hezai Laisiukwak gage raulu. Ge pa tangtsukang kedi ge keulwe mhu bang kang gage sumlu, RAMPAUBE recabam taiga. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Joshua mina pelane da rangdi, “Pielo, tangtsukang aide anui ziemne zierang ge zieda. RAMPAUBE anuida kerang samdung pelane siu luda. Cine cide nnui gu zierangketei ge zieda, nnui Tinggwang de nnui mlai dicai.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Ge Joshua mina pe deu gumkelu gage langgai di.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sampet kebeu deu gage kungkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Ma aidungde tei kedicai, RAMPAUBE kilabe Nun napei Joshua mmi haigekerei dau tsaidi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Penui pecu pe magum deurai gage kungdi, Timnath Serah Ephraim kideutu deudi Gaash Deutu, tingtünle gage kungdi. <verse eid="JOS 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Cu Joshua tingdau Israelme pelane RAMPAUBE gwatei eh lung, nah Joshua caide muiteume pelane penui peting ketiee ge tei gwang, RAMPAUBE Israelme ziemne pe bata tei kegai pelane cibam.<verse eid="JOS 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Israel namedung Egypt gade Joseph raadung penui pwa nghang Shechem gage kungdi, Jacob ne Shechem pei Hamor namedung dade rangkanggeu hai le lui kelu hangdeu kesa ga, nah Joseph namedung ne magum tei kelu teilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:18-20">Ken. 33:18-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Cipaucai Aaron napei Eleazar tsaidi, penui pecu pe napei Phinehas deu Gibeah gage kungdi, kideutu deudi Ephraim ga pecu kepeu deu ga.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>